(4,'Project Research Scientist I – 01 Posts	','AIIMS Bhopal	','Bhopal','Full-time','','The All India Institute of Medical Sciences Bhopal (AIIMS Bhopal) has officially released a recruitment notification for Project Research Scientist I. For all details regarding the recruitment process, eligibility, and application procedure, refer to the official notification. Eligible candidates can download it from the link below\n\nApplication Fee\n\nNil\nAIIMS Bhopal Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nStarting Date for Apply: 12-09-2025\nLast Date for Apply: 26-09-2025\nDate and Time of Written test / Interview: 27-09-2025\n\n\nNotification -https://aiimsbhopal.edu.in/AIIMSFiles/career/jonUnderProject/Download/Detailed%20Advertisement_12092025.pdf',1,'2025-09-12','2025-09-26','2025-09-13 09:40:21',NULL,NULL,0),
(5,'IBPS RRB Gramin Bank Recruitment 2025 - Apply online for 13,217 Office Assistant, Officers Posts by 21 Sep','IBPS Gramin Bank','AP','Full-time','','IBPS RRB Gramin Bank Recruitment 2025: Apply for 13,217 Vacancies Across India\nThe wait is finally over for all banking aspirants—IBPS RRB Recruitment 2025 has been announced, and the official notification was released on 31st August 2025! This year, a total of 13,217 vacancies have been opened for various positions, including Office Assistants (Clerk) and Officer Scale I, II & III. The online application window is open from 1st September to 21st September 2025, Bank job\n\nIBPS RRB 2025 Exam Highlights\nCategory	Details\nOrganization	Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS)\nPost Name	Clerk, Officer Scale-I, II, III\nVacancy	13,217\nRegistration Dates	1st to 21st September 2025\nExam Mode	Online\nRecruitment ProcessBank jobJob vacancy notifications	Officer Scale I: Prelims, Mains, Interview\nOffice Assistant: Prelims and Mains\nOfficer Scale II & III: Single Exam, Interview\nSalary	Varies for different posts\nOfficial Website	www.ibps.in\nImportant Dates for IBPS RRB 2025 Exam\nActivity	Dates\nIBPS RRB Notification Release	31st August 2025\nOnline Application Starts	1st September 2025\nLast Date to Apply	21st September 2025\nPrelims Exam (Clerk)Anganwadi recruitment updates	6th, 7th, 13th & 14th December 2025\nMains Exam (Clerk)	1st February 2026\nPrelims Exam (PO)	22nd & 23rd November 2025\nMains Exam (PO)	28th December 2025\nOfficer Scale II & III Exam	28th December 2025\n\nIBPS RRB Vacancy 2025 - Post-Wise Distribution\nPost	Vacancies\nOffice Assistants (Multipurpose)	7,972\nOfficer Scale-I (PO)	3,907\nOfficer Scale-II (Agriculture Officer)	50\nOfficer Scale-II (Law Officer)	48\nOfficer Scale-II (CA)	69\nOfficer Scale-II (IT Officer)	87\nOfficer Scale-II (General Banking)	854\nOfficer Scale-II (Marketing Officer)	15\nOfficer Scale-II (Treasury Manager)	16\nOfficer Scale-III (Senior Manager)	199\nTotal Vacancies	13,217\nIBPS RRB 2025 Eligibility Criteria\n\nCandidates applying for the IBPS RRB 2025 Exam must meet specific eligibility criteria including age limits, educational qualifications, and language proficiency. Here are the requirements:\n\nNationality: Must be an Indian citizen, a subject of Nepal or Bhutan, or a Tibetan Refugee.\nAge Limit (As on 01.09.2025):\nOffice Assistant (Clerk): 18 to 28 years\nOfficer Scale-I (PO): 18 to 30 years\nOfficer Scale-II (Manager): 21 to 32 years\nOfficer Scale-III (Senior Manager): 21 to 40 years\nAge Relaxation: As per government norms for SC/ST, OBC, PWD, and Ex-Servicemen categories.\nEducational Qualification:\nOffice Assistant: Bachelor\'s degree in any discipline\nOfficer Scale-I: Bachelor\'s degree (preference for specific fields like Agriculture, IT, etc.)\nOfficer Scale-II & III: Relevant experience and qualification in specific fields\nIBPS RRB 2025 Application Fee\n\nOfficer (Scale I, II & III)\n\nFor SC/ST/ PwBD candidates: Rs.175/- (Inclusive of GST)\nFor all others: Rs.850/- (Inclusive of GST)\nOffice Assistants (Multipurpose)\n\nFor SC/ST/ PwBD/ ESM /DESM candidates: Rs.175/- (Inclusive of GST)\nFor all others: Rs.850/- (Inclusive of GST)\nIBPS RRB 2025 Salary Structure\nPost	Salary Range\nOfficer Scale-I (PO)	₹60,000 to ₹61,000 per month\nOfficer Scale-II	₹75,000 to ₹77,000 per month\nOfficer Scale-III	₹80,000 to ₹90,000 per month\nOffice Assistant (Multipurpose)	₹35,000 to ₹37,000 per month\n\n\n\n\n',13217,'2025-09-13','2025-09-21','2025-09-13 09:45:49','https://ibpsreg.ibps.in/rrbxivaug25/','https://www.ibps.in/wp-content/uploads/CRP-RRBs-XIV_Final_AD_31.08.25.pdf',0),
(6,'BRBNMPL Recruitment 2025 - Apply Online for 88 Deputy Manager, Process Assistant Grade I (Trainee) Posts','BRBNMPL','All India','Full-time','','The Bhartiya Reserve Bank Note Mudran Pvt (BRBNMPL) Recruitment 2025 for 88 posts of Deputy Manager, Process Assistant Grade I (Trainee). Candidates with Any Graduate, Diploma, ITI, 10TH Can Apply Online. The online application opens on 10-08-2025, and closes on 29-09-2025. The candidate shall apply online through BRBNMPL website, brbnmpl.co.in\n\nName of the Post: BRBNMPL Deputy Manager, Process Assistant Grade I (Trainee) Online Form 2025\n\nPost Date: 06-08-2025\n\nTotal Vacancy: 88\n\nBrief Information: The Bhartiya Reserve Bank Note Mudran Pvt (BRBNMPL) has announced a notification for the recruitment of Deputy Manager, Process Assistant Grade I (Trainee) Vacancy. Eligible Candidates who are interested in the vacancy details & completed all eligibility criteria can read the notification & Apply\n\nApplication Fee\n\n₹600/- for all applicants and Nil for SC/ST/PwBD/Women/Ex-servicemen/ Internal (BRBNMPL) applicants \n₹400/- for all applicants and Nil for SC/ST/PwBD/Women/Ex-servicemen applicants.\nPayment Mode: Online\n\nBRBNMPL Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nStarting Date for Apply Online: 10-08-2025\nLast Date for Apply Online: 29-09-2025\nQualification\n\nCandidates Should Posses Any Graduate, Diploma, ITI, 10TH \nBRBNMPL Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\nPost Name	Total\nDeputy Manager	24\nProcess Assistant Grade I (Trainee)	64\n\nExtend Notification - https://www.brbnmpl.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Corrigendum-Advt-2-_-2025_12092025.pdf\n\nOfficial Website - https://www.brbnmpl.co.in/',88,'2025-09-13','2025-09-29','2025-09-13 09:50:01',NULL,NULL,0),
(7,'Power Grid Corporation of India Limited (POWERGRID) Recruitment 2025-Apply Online for 1543 Field Engineer and Supervisor Posts by Sep 17 Power Grid ','Power Grid Corporation of India Limited (POWERGRID)','CG','Full-time','','Power Grid Corporation of India Limited (POWERGRID) Recruitment 2025 for 1543 posts of Field Engineer and Supervisor. \nCandidates with B.Sc, B.Tech/B.E, Diploma Can Apply Online. The online application opens on 27-08-2025, and closes on 17-09-2025. The candidate shall apply online through POWERGRID website, powergrid.in\n\nName of the Post: POWERGRID Field Engineer and Supervisor Online Form 2025\n\nPost Date: 28-08-2025\n\n:atest Update: 12-09-2025\n\nTotal Vacancy: 1543\n\nBrief Information: The POWERGRID has announced a notification for the recruitment of Field Engineer and Supervisor Vacancy on contract basis. Eligible Candidates who are interested in the vacancy details & completed all eligibility criteria can read the notification & Apply\n\nApplication Fee\n\nFor Field Engineer: Rs. 400/-\nFor Field Supervisor: Rs. 300/-\nFor SC/ ST/ PwBD/ ExSM Category: NIL\n\nPOWERGRID Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nStarting Date for Apply Online: 27-08-2025 (1700 hrs)\nLast Date for Apply Online: 17-09-2025 (2359 hrs)\nCut-Off date for the purpose of Upper Age Limit & PostQualification Work Experience: 17.09.2025\nDate of POWERGRID Common FTE Written Test 2025: Will be notified separately on the website\n\nPOWERGRID Recruitment 2025 Age Limit (as on 17-09-2025)\nMaximum Age Limit: 29 Years\nAge relaxation is admissible as per rules\n\nQualification\n\nFull time B.E /B.Tech / B.Sc (Engg.) in Electrical discipline or equivalent discipline from recognized University / Institute with minimum 55% marks.\nFull Time Diploma in Electrical or equivalent discipline from recognized Technical Board / Institute with minimum 55% marks\n\nSalary\n\n\nCompensation & benefits for Field Engineer/Field Supervisor (excluding RDSS project):\n\nField Engineers will be paid monthly remuneration in the pay band of ₹ 30,000-3%-1,20,000/- with initial basic pay of ₹ 30,000/- + Industrial DA + HRA+ Perks @ 35% of Basic Pay with an annual CTC of ₹ 8.9 Lakhs approx.\nField Supervisors will be paid monthly remuneration in the pay band of ₹ 23,000-3%-1,05,000/- with initial basic pay of ₹ 23,000/- + Industrial DA + HRA+ Perks @35% of Basic Pay with an annual CTC of ₹ 6.8 Lakhs approx.\nCompensation & benefits for Field Engineer/Field Supervisor (for RDSS project):\n\nField Engineer will be paid monthly remuneration in the pay band of ₹ 30,000-3%-1,20,000/- with initial basic pay of ₹ 30,000/- + Industrial DA + HRA + Perks* with an annual CTC of ₹ 8.9 Lakhs approx.\nField Supervisors will be paid monthly remuneration in the pay band of ₹ 23,000-3%-1,05,000/- with initial basic pay of ₹ 23,000/- + Industrial DA + HRA + Perks* with an annual CTC of ₹ 6.8 Lakhs approx.\n\nPOWERGRID Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\nPost Name	Total\nPowergrid Common FTE Written Test - 2025\nField Engineer (Electrical)	532\nField Engineer (Civil)	198\nField Supervisor (Electrical)	535\nField Supervisor (Civil)	193\nField Supervisor (Electronics & Communication)	85\n\nNotification - https://www.powergrid.in/sites/default/files/job_opportunities_document/eng_of_FE_FTB.pdf\n\nOfficial Website - https://www.powergrid.in/\n\n\n\n\n',1543,'2025-09-12','2025-09-17','2025-09-13 09:54:47','https://www.powergrid.in/','https://www.powergrid.in/',0),
(8,'Rajasthan Police Constable Recruitment 2025 - Apply Online for 167 Posts by Oct 04','Rajasthan Police	','Rajasthan ','Full-time','','The Rajasthan Police Recruitment 2025 for 167 posts of Constable. Candidates with 12TH Can Apply Online. The online application opens on 12-09-2025, and closes on 04-10-2025. The candidate shall apply online through Rajasthan Police website, police.rajasthan.gov.in\n\nThe Rajasthan Police has announced a notification for the recruitment of Constable Vacancy. Eligible Candidates who are interested in the vacancy details & completed all eligibility criteria can read the notification & Apply\n\nApplication Fee\n\nFor Gen / BC / MBC (CL) category: 600/-\nFor EWS / MBC / BC (NCL) category: 400/-\nFor SC / ST / TSP / Sahariya category: Rs. 400/-\nFor Error Correction Charges: 300/-\nPayment Mode: Online\n\n\nRajasthan Police Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nStarting Date for Apply Online: 12-09-2025\nLast Date for Apply Online: 04-10-2025\nRajasthan Police Recruitment 2025 Age Limit (01-01-2026)\nMinimum Age Limit: 18 Years\nMaximum Age Limit: 33 Years\nAge relaxation is admissible as per rules\nQualification\n\nCandidates Should Posses 12TH Pass. Rajasthan CET (12th Level) 2024 Passed.\nRajasthan Police Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\nPost Name	Total\nConstable (Sports Quota)	167\n\nApply Date Changed - https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/09/897652-68c4e785d373385569295.pdf\n\nNotification - https://police.rajasthan.gov.in/uploads/sport_CT_2025_7fafdba13c.pdf\n\nOfficial Website	- https://police.rajasthan.gov.in/\n',167,'2025-09-13','2025-10-04','2025-09-13 09:58:39',NULL,NULL,0),
(9,'Employees\' State Insurance Corporation (ESIC) Recruitment 2025 – Walk in for 13 Specialists, Senior Resident Posts','Employees\' State Insurance Corporation (ESIC)','HP','Full-time','','Employees State Insurance Corporation (ESIC) Recruitment 2025 for 13 posts of Specialists, Senior Resident. Candidates with DNB, PG Diploma, MS/MD Can attend the walkin. The Walk-in on 30-09-2025. For detailed information please visit ESIC official website, esic.gov.in\n\nApplication Fee\n\nNot Mentioned on Site\n\nESIC Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nDate of Walkin Interview: 30-09-2025\n\n\nESIC Recruitment 2025 Age Limit\nFor Senior Resident: Upper age limit is 45 years for 03 years engagement\nFor specialists: Age not exceeding 67 years as on the date of interview.\n\nQualification\n\nFor Senior Resident: PG Degree or diploma / DNB in concerned specialty from recognized university. Candidates with MBBS Degree with 02-year experience in concerned specialty may apply.\nFor specialists: PG Degree or equivalent with 03-year Post PG experience or PG Diploma with 05-year post PG experience in respective specialty from recognized university. A candidate should have valid registration from MCI / State Medical Council.\n\nESIC Specialists, Senior Resident Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\nPost Name	Total\nSpecialists	06\nSenior Resident	07\n\nNotification - https://esic.gov.in/attachments/recruitmentfile/Walk_in_interview_to_hire_Specialists_amp_Senior_resident_on_Contract_in_ESIC_Hospital_Bikaner_Rajasthan_1757661003.pdf\n\nOfficial Website - https://esic.gov.in/\n',13,'2025-09-12','2025-09-30','2025-09-13 10:05:19','https://esic.gov.in','https://esic.gov.in/attachments/recruitmentfile/Walk_in_interview_to_hire_Specialists_amp_Senior_resident_on_Contract_in_ESIC_Hospital_Bikaner_Rajasthan_1757661003.pdf',0),
(10,'Oil India Grade III, V & VII Recruitment 2025 - Apply Online for 23 Posts by Oct 10','Oil India','All India','Full-time','','The Oil India Recruitment 2025 for 23 posts of Grade III, V & VII. Candidates with Any Graduate, B.Com, Diploma, ITI, 12TH Can Apply Online. The online application opens on 10-09-2025, and closes on 10-10-2025. The candidate shall apply online through Oil India website, oil-india.com\n\nApplication Fee\n\nFor General/OBC candidate(s): Rs. 200/- as online application fee exclusive of GST and payment gateway/ bank charges.\nFor SC/ST/EWS/Persons with Benchmark Disabilities/Ex-Servicemen candidates: NIL\n\nOil India Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nStarting Date for Apply Online: 10-09-2025 14:00 hours\nLast Date for Apply Online: 10-10-2025 23:59 hours\nDate of Computer Based Test (CBT): 30-11-2025 (Tentative) (Exact date shall be intimated at the time of issue of Admit Cards)\n\nOil India Recruitment 2025 Age Limit (as on 10-10-2025_)\nMinimum Age Limit: 18 Years\nMaximum Age Limit: 35 Years\nAge relaxation is admissible as per rules\n\nQualification\n\nPassed 10+2 in any stream from Government Recognized Board/ University\nPassed Diploma/Certificate in Computer Application of minimum 06 (six) months duration and should be fully conversant with MS Word, MS Excel, MS Powerpoint, etc\nTrade Certificate in Fitter Trade from a Government Recognized Institute. Must have passed Class 10 from a Government Recognized Board.\nTrade Certificate in Mechanic Diesel Trade from a Government Recognized Institute. Must have passed Class 10 from a Government Recognized Board.\nTrade Certificate in Electrician Trade from a Government Recognized Institute. Must have passed Class 10 from a Government Recognized Board.\nMust possess valid permit to work as Wireman issued by competent authority by the state of Rajasthan or equivalent Wiremen permit issued by other state.\nPassed B. Com from a Government Recognized University/ Board/ Institute.\nMust be a graduate from a recognized university with major in Hindi and English as one of the elective subjects in Pass Course\nPassed 03 (three) years Diploma in Civil Engineering from a Government Recognized University/Board/Institute. Must have passed Class 10 from a Government board.\nPassed 03 (three) years Diploma in Electrical Engineering from a Government recognized University /Board /Institution. Must have passed Class 10 from a Government Recognized Board\n\nSalary\n\nGRADE-III (PAY SCALE ₹ 26,600.00 – 90,000.00)\nGRADE-V (PAY SCALE ₹ 32,000.00 – 1,27,000.00)\nGRADE-VII (PAY SCALE ₹ 37,500.00 – 1,45,000.00)\n\nOil India Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\n\nJob vacancy notifications	Total\nGrade III	14\nGrade V	        04\nGrade VII	05\n\nApply Online - https://cdn.digialm.com/EForms/configuredHtml/1258/94290/Index.html\n\nNotification - https://g03.tcsion.com//per/g03/pub/726/EForms/image/ImageDocUpload/71161/1/9102563400.pdf',23,'2025-09-11','2025-10-10','2025-09-13 10:08:32',NULL,NULL,0),
