ll Notification Before Apply\nImportant Links\nApplication Form For Teaching - https://apsjaipur.edu.in/advertisements/Application%20Form%20For%20Teaching%20Staff%20-%20Sep%202025.pdf\nApplication Form For Non Teaching - https://apsjaipur.edu.in/advertisements/Application%20Form%20Non%20Teaching.pdf\n\nNotification - https://apsjaipur.edu.in/advertisements/add.jpg',16,'2025-09-09','2025-09-24','2025-09-13 10:12:13',NULL,NULL,0),
(13,'Tata Memorial Hospital Project Scientist I Recruitment 2025 – Walk in','Tata Memorial Hospital','MH','Full-time','','Tata Memorial Hospital Recruitment 2025 for 01 posts of Project Scientist I. Candidates with M.Sc, M.Phil/Ph.D Can attend the walkin. The Walk-in on 24-09-2025. For detailed information please visit Tata Memorial Hospital official website, tmc.gov.in.',1,'2025-09-13','2025-09-24','2025-09-13 13:01:45','https://tmc.gov.in/','https://tmc.gov.in/event/upload/12092025_8/TMC-AD-116-2025.pdf',0),
(14,'UPSC Recruitment 2025 - Apply Online for 213 Post Lecturer, Medical Officer and More Posts by Oct 02','UPSC','AP','Full-time','','The Union Public Service Commission (UPSC) Recruitment 2025 for 213 posts of Lecturer, Medical Officer and More. Candidates with LLB, MBBS Can Apply Online. The online application opens on 13-09-2025, and closes on 02-10-2025. The candidate shall apply online through UPSC website, upsc.gov.in.\n\nApplication Fee\n\nFor all candidates: Rs. 25/- (Rupees Twenty five)\nFor  SC/ ST/ PwBD/ Women candidates: NIL\n\nUPSC Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nStarting Date for Apply Online: 13-09-2025\nLast Date for Apply Online: 02-10-2025\nLast Date for Printing Application: 03-10-2025\n\nUPSC Recruitment 2025 Age Limit\nFor UR Category: 50 Years\nFor OBC Category: 53 Years\nFor SC/ ST Category: 55 Years\nFor PwBD Category: 56 Years\nFor EWS Category: 40 Years\nFor UR/ EWS Category: 35 Years\nCandidates Kindly refer to the Official Notification for Age Limit Details.\n\nQualification\n\nDegree in Law of a recognized University or equivalent.\nPost Graduation in Urdu with B.Ed.\nA recognized MBBS degree qualification included in the Chapter VI of National Medical Commission Act 2019.\nBachelor’s Degree from a recognized University or Institution.\nMaster’s Degree of a recognized University or Institution in Social Work or Sociology or Economics or Anthropology or Social Anthropology or Applied Anthropology or Statistics or Psychology or Geography or Mathematics (with Statistics)\n\nUPSC Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\nPost Name	Total\nAdditional Government Advocate	05\nAssistant Legal Adviser	16\nAdditional Legal Adviser	02\nAssistant Government Advocate	01\nDeputy Government Advocate	02\nDeputy Legal Adviser	12\nLecturer (Urdu)	15\nMedical Officer	125\nAccounts Officer	32\nAssistant Director	03\n\n',213,'2025-09-15','2025-10-02','2025-09-15 05:43:21','https://upsconline.gov.in/ora/VacancyNoticePub.php','https://upsc.gov.in/sites/default/files/AdvtNo-13-2025-Engl-120925.pdf',0),
(15,'DoT Junior Engineer Telecom Recruitment 2025 - Apply Offline by Oct 31','Department of Telecommunications','MP','Full-time','','The Department of Telecommunications (DoT) Recruitment 2025 for 02 posts of Junior Engineer Telecom. Candidates with B.Tech/ B.E Can Apply Offline. The Offline application opens on 18-09-2025, and closes on 31-10-2025. The candidate shall apply Offline through DoT website, dot.gov.in\n\nApplication Fee\n\n\nNot Mentioned.\nDoT Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nStarting Date for Apply: 18-09-2025\nLast Date for Apply: 31-10-2025\n\nDoT Recruitment 2025 Age Limit\nMaximum Age limit: 56 Years\nAge relaxation is applicable as per rules.\n\nQualification\nBachelor Degree in Engineering or Technology in Electronics/ Communication/ Electrical and Electronic Communication/ Electrical/ Computer Science/ Information Technology/ Instrumentation From a recognized University or Institute.\n\n\nSalary\n\nLevel-6 in the Pay Matrix (Rs.35,400- 1,12,400).\n\nPost Name	Total\nJunior Engineer Telecom	02\n',2,'2025-09-18','2025-09-18','2025-09-19 08:10:22','https://dot.gov.in/','https://dot.gov.in/sites/default/files/Notification%20for%20Vacancy%20Circular%20on%20Deputation%20Basis%20for%20the%20post%20of%20JE%28T%29%20TES%20Grp%20B%20Level%20-6.pdf?download=1',0),
