(19,'Eklavya Model Residential Schools (EMRS) Teaching and Non Teaching Recruitment 2025 - Apply Online for 7267 TGT, Accountant and Other Posts by Oct 23','Eklavya Model Residential Schools (EMRS)','DL','Full-time','','Eklavya Model Residential Schools (EMRS) Recruitment 2025 for 7267 posts of Teaching and Non Teaching. Candidates with Any Graduate, B.Com, B.Ed, B.Sc, Diploma, 12TH, 10TH, Any Post Graduate Can Apply Online. The online application opens on 19-09-2025, and closes on 23-10-2025. The candidate shall apply online through EMRS website, nests.tribal.gov.in\n\nApplication Fee\n\nGen / OBC / EWS Candidates - For Principal Post: Rs 2500/-\nGen / OBC / EWS Candidates - For TGT & PGT Teacher: Rs 2000/-\nGen / OBC / EWS Candidates - For Non-Teaching Posts: Rs 1500/-\nAll Females / SC / ST / PH - For all Posts: Rs 500/-\nPayment Mode: Through Online\n\nEMRS Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\n\nStarting Date for Apply Online: 19-09-2025\nLast Date for Apply Online: 23-10-2025\n\nMRS Recruitment 2025 Age Limit\nMaximum age Limit for Principal Post: 50 Years\nMaximum age Limit for PGT Teacher: 40 Years\nMaximum age Limit for TGT Teacher: 35 Years\nMaximum age Limit for Accountant: 30 Years\nMaximum age Limit for Lab Attendant: 30 Years\nMaximum age Limit for Hostel Warden: 35 Years\nMaximum age Limit for Female Staff Nurse: 35 Years\nMaximum age Limit for Jr. Secretariat Assist.: 30 Years\nAge relaxation is applicable as per rules.\n\nQualification\n\n\nPrincipal: PG Degree and B.Ed \nPost Graduate Teacher (PGT): PG Degree in Related Subject and B.Ed\nTrained Graduate Teacher (TGT): Graduate in Related Subject, B.Ed\nFemale Staff Nurse: B.Sc. Nursing\nHostel Warden: Graduation Degree in any discipline.\nAccountant: Graduation Degree in Commerce.\nJr. Secretariat Assistant: 12th \nLab Attendant: 10th, Diploma in Lab Technique  OR 12th Passed with Science.\n\nMonthly Salary\n\nPrincipal: Rs. 78800-209200/-\nPGT Teacher: Rs. 47600-151100/-\nTGT Teacher: Rs. 44900-142400/-\nLibrarian: Rs 44900-142400/-\nArt Teacher: Rs. 35400-112400/-\nMusic Teacher: Rs. 35400-112400/-\nPhysical Edu. Teacher: Rs. 35400-112400/-\nAccountant: Rs. 35400-112400/-\nStaff Nurse: Rs. 29200-92300/-\nHostel Warden: Rs. 29200-92300/-\nJr. Secretariat Assistant: Rs. 19900-63200/-\nLab Attendant: Rs. 18000-56900/-\n\nMRS Teaching and Non Teaching Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\n\nPost Name	Total\nPrincipal	225\nPGT Teacher	1460\nHostel Warden (Male)	346\nJr. Secretariat Assistant (Clerk)	228\nAccountant	61\nFemale Staff Nurse	550\nTGT Teacher	3962\nHostel Warden (Female)	289\nLab Attendant	146',7267,'2025-09-20','2025-10-23','2025-09-20 09:48:02','https://examinationservices.nic.in/recSys2025/root/Home.aspx?enc=Ei4cajBkK1gZSfgr53ImFZ5JDNNIP7I8JbNwGOl976uPeIvr9X7G7iVESmo7y1L6','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/09/968509-68ce277a409ef39614169.pdf',0),
(20,'IIT Tirupati Research Associate I Recruitment 2025 - Apply Online by Sep 30','IIT Tirupati','AP','Full-time','','The Indian Institute of Technology Tirupati (IIT Tirupati) Recruitment 2025 for 01 posts of Research Associate I. Candidates with M.Phil/Ph.D Can Apply Online. The online application opens on 16-09-2025, and closes on 30-09-2025. The candidate shall apply online through IIT Tirupati website, iittp.ac.in\n\nApplication Fee\n\nNot Mentioned\n\nIT Tirupati Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nStarting Date for Apply Online: 16-09-2025\nLast Date for Apply Online: 30-09-2025\n\nIIT Tirupati Recruitment 2025 Age Limit\n\nNot Mentioned\n\nQualification\n\nPh.D in Chemical/Materials Engineering, Chemistry/Physics or related discipline\n\nSalary\n\nMonthly Salary INR 65,000 (consolidates)\n\nIIT Tirupati Research Associate I Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\nPost Name	Total\nResearch Associate I	01',1,'2025-09-20','2025-09-30','2025-09-20 09:54:47','https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd7ew6ug1XthEUDECKws_XevE7WpOMqh9hRXfwMdCRyCLnVyA/viewform?pli=1','https://files.iittp.ac.in/pdfs/announcements/2025/AdvtIITTCSRC2025-2613.pdf',0),
(21,'Arunachal Pradesh PSC Junior Engineer Recruitment 2025 - Apply Online for 413 Posts by Oct 10','Arunachal Pradesh PSC','AP','Full-time','','The Arunachal Pradesh Public Service Commission (Arunachal Pradesh PSC) Recruitment 2025 for 413 posts of Junior Engineer. Candidates with B.Tech/B.E, Diploma Can Apply Online. The online application opens on 18-09-2025, and closes on 10-10-2025. The candidate shall apply online through Arunachal Pradesh PSC website, appsc.gov.in\n\nApplication Fee\n\nFor APST candidates: Rs 150/-\nFor all Other Candidates: Rs 200/-\nFor PwD candidates: Nil\nPayment Mode: Through Online\n\nArunachal Pradesh PSC Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\n\nStarting Date for Apply Online: 18-09-2025\nLast Date for Apply Online: 10-10-2025\nExam Date: 11-01-2026 (tentatively)\n\nArunachal Pradesh PSC Recruitment 2025 Age Limit\nMinimum Age Limit: 18 Years\nMaximum Age limit: 35 Years\nAge relaxation is applicable as per rules.\n\nQualification\n\n\nMinimum 3 (three) years Diploma/Bachelor\'s Degree or Bachelor of Technology or equivalent from a recognized Institutions/University\nPay\n\nPay Matrix Level-6 (Rs 35400-112400/-)\n\nArunachal Pradesh PSC Junior Engineer Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\ns\nPost Name	Total\nJunior Engineer (Civil)	301\nJunior Engineer (Mech/Elect.)	01\nJunior Engineer (Electro - Mechanical)	32\nJunior Engineer (Elect/ Mech/ Comp/ IT & Electronics & Telecom )	79\n',413,'2025-09-18','2025-10-10','2025-09-20 09:57:37','https://appsc.gov.in/Index/institute_home/ins/RECINS001','https://appsc.gov.in/upload/RECINS001/JE_LONG_ADD_20250917_175119.pdf',0),
(22,'AIIMS Guwahati Survey Field Data Collector Recruitment 2025 - Apply Online by Oct 10 Anganwadi recruitment updates','AIIMS Guwahati','AS','Full-time','','The All India Institute of Medical Sciences Guwahati (AIIMS Guwahati) Recruitment 2025 for 02 posts of NMHS Survey Field Data Collector. Candidates with M.Sc Can Apply Online. The online application on 10-10-2025. The candidate shall apply online through AIIMS Guwahati website, aiimsguwahati.in\n\nApplication Fee\n\nNot Mentioned\nJob vacancy notifications\nAIIMS Guwahati Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nLast Date for Apply Online: 10-10-2025\nAIIMS Guwahati Recruitment 2025 Age Limit\n\nMaximum Age limit: 40 / 45 Years\nQualification\n\nMasters in Psychology / Social work / Sociology\n\nSalary\n\nConsolidated Rs.45,000/- per month; excluding local travel which will be borne separately.\n\nAIIMS Guwahati NMHS Survey Field Data Collector Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\n\nvacancy notifications	Total\nNMHS Survey Field Data Collector	02',2,'2025-09-19','2025-09-10','2025-09-20 10:00:22','https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf16MYde9XeRFiAjt6EDJmHtjtz5qJpPHv5c_IQv8keXTq1aA/viewform','https://aiimsguwahati.in/viewfile.aspx?fname=005d3d8f.pdf&ftype=pdf&rdoctype=cms',0),
(23,'East Central Railway Sports Quota Recruitment 2025 - Apply Offline for 56 Posts by-Oct 21','East Central Railway','BR','Full-time','','The East Central Railway Recruitment 2025 for 56 posts of Sports Quota. Candidates with Any Graduate, Diploma, ITI, 12TH Can Apply Offline. The Offline application opens on 20-09-2025, and closes on 21-10-2025. The candidate shall apply Offline through East Central Railway website, ecr.indianrailways.gov.in\n\n\nApplication Fee\n\nRefer Official Notification\nEast Central Railway Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\n\nStarting Date for Apply: 20-09-2025\nLast Date for Apply: 21-10-2025\n\nEast Central Railway Recruitment 2025 Age Limit\nMinimum Age Limit: 18 Years\nMaximum Age Limit: 25 Years\nAge relaxation is admissible as per rules\n\nQualification\n\nCandidates Should Posses Graduate, Diploma, ITI, 12TH in relevant Subject\n\nPay\n\n\nPay Level 4/5, Basic Pay 25500/29200 & Pay Level 2/3, Basic Pay 19000/21700; 10 (Ten) vacancies in Pay Level 1, Basic Pay 18000 in ECR HQ/Hajipur and total 25 (Twenty Five) vacancies in Pay Level 1, Basic Pay 18000 in all the 5-Divisions i.e. Dhanbad, Danapur. DDU, Sonpur and Samastipur against Sports Quota (Open Advertisement).\nEast Central Railway Sports Quota Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\n\nJob vacancy notifications\nPost Name	Total\nRequirement of sportspersons in HQ/ECR, Hajipur \nWrestling (Men) 	31\nBasketball (Men)\nBasketball (Women) \nKabbadi (Women) \nFootball (Women) \nBadminton (Men)\nBadminton (Women)\nHockey (Women) \nRequirement of sportspersons in Pay Level-1 in all the 05-Divisons of East Central Railway\nCricket (Men) 	25\nBadminton (Men)\nBadminton (Women)\nWrestling (Men)\nVolleyball (Men)\nHockey (Women)\nInterested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply\n',56,'2025-09-20','2025-10-20','2025-09-20 10:05:05','https://ecr.indianrailways.gov.in/','https://ecr.indianrailways.gov.in/cris//uploads/files/1758339507011-Recruitment%20under%20Sports%20Quota%20for%2