(24,'PGIMER Recruitment 2025 - Apply Offline for Senior Demonstrator, Junior Demonstrator Posts by Sep 27','PGIMER','CG','Full-time','','The Postgraduate Institute of Medical Education and Research (PGIMER) Recruitment 2025 for 05 posts of Senior Demonstrator, Junior Demonstrator. Candidates with M.A, M.Sc, M.Phil/Ph.D, MPH Can Apply Offline. The Offline application opens on 18-09-2025, and closes on 27-09-2025. The candidate shall apply Offline through PGIMER website, pgimer.edu.in\n\nApplication Fee\n\nNot Mentioned\n\nJob vacancy notifications\n\nPGIMER Recruitment 2025 Important Dates\nStarting Date for Apply: 18-09-2025\nLast Date for Apply: 27-09-2025\nInterview Date: 30-09-2025\n\nPGIMER Recruitment 2025 Age Limit\n\nSenior Demonstrator of Health Economics: Upper age limit: 45 years\nSenior Demonstrator of Nutrition: Upper age limit: 45 years\nJunior Demonstrator of Epidemiology: Upper age limit: 45 years\nJunior Demonstrator Environmental Health: Upper age limit: 45 years\nJunior Demonstrator of Nutrition: Upper age limit: 45 years\n \n\nQualification\n\nSenior Demonstrator of Health Economics: M.A/M.Sc. in Health Economics or MPH and Ph.D (Thesis in Health Economics)\nSenior Demonstrator of Health Economics: M.A/M.Sc. in Nutrition or MPH and Ph.D (Thesis in Nutrition)\nJunior Demonstrator of Epidemiology: M.A/M.Sc. in Epidemiology or MPH\nJunior Demonstrator of Epidemiology: M.A/M.Sc. in Environmental Health or MPH\nJunior Demonstrator of Epidemiology: M.A/M.Sc. in Nutrition or MPH\n\nSalary\n\n\nSenior Demonstrator of Health Economics: Pay scale: - As per 7 CPC Level 10 (Basic 56100).\nSenior Demonstrator of Health Economics: Pay scale: - As per 7% CPC Level 10 (Basic 56100).\nJunior Demonstrator of Epidemiology: Pay scale: - As per 7 CPC Level 6 (Basic 35400).\nJunior Demonstrator of Epidemiology: Pay scale: - As per 7* CPC Level 6 (Basic 35400).\nJunior Demonstrator of Epidemiology: Pay scale: - As per 74 CPC Level 6 (Basic 35400).\n\nPGIMER Senior Demonstrator, Junior Demonstrator Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details\n\nJob vacancy notifications\nPost Name	Total\nSenior Demonstrator	03\nJunior Demonstrator	02',5,'2025-09-20','2025-09-27','2025-09-20 10:09:07','https://pgimer.edu.in/','https://pgimer.edu.in/PGIMER_PORTAL/PGIMERPORTAL/Vacancies/JSP/ViewAll.jsp?record=14023',0),
