(50,'Centre for Development of Advanced Computing (CDAC) Recruitments 2025 Apply Online for Post-646 Managers, Project Associate and More Other Posts','Centre for Development of Advanced Computing (CDAC)','AS','Full-time','','I wanted to bring to your attention the recruitment announcement from the Centre for Development of Advanced Computing (CDAC) for the year 2025. They are looking to fill 646 positions for various roles, including Manager, Project Associate, and others. This opportunity is available for candidates with qualifications in B.Tech/B.E, M.E/M.Tech, MCA, M.Phil, or Ph.D.\n\nThe online application process will commence on October 1, 2025, and will conclude on October 20, 2025. Interested candidates can apply directly through the CDAC website at cdac.in.\n\nPlease feel free to share this information with anyone who might be interested.',646,'2025-10-05','2025-10-20','2025-10-05 02:55:00','https://careers.cdac.in/','https://careers.cdac.in/',0),
