(55,'Jamia Millia Islamia (JMI) 2025 Apply now for - 2 Research Associate, JRF Posts','Jamia Millia Islamia (JMI)','DL','Full-time','','opportunity to apply for the Jamia Millia Islamia (JMI) Recruitment 2025. There are two available positions for Research Associate and Junior Research Fellow (JRF).\n\nThe deadline for submitting offline applications is 13th October 2025. This is a great opportunity for eligible candidates. Please ensure you apply directly through the official JMI website at jmi.ac.in.\n\nDon’t miss out on this chance!',2,'2025-10-05','2025-10-13','2025-10-05 04:29:15','https://jmi.ac.in/','https://jmi.ac.in/upload/advertisement/jobs_as_2025september30.pdf',0),
(56,'Mormugao Port Authority (MPT Goa) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 03 Senior Advocate, Junior Advocate, and Additional Positions','Mormugao Port Authority (MPT Goa)','AP','Full-time','','MPT Goa Recruitment 2025 - Applications are being accepted offline for the positions of Senior Advocate, Junior Advocate, and additional roles (03 posts). Qualified graduates may submit their applications by 2nd November at mptgoa.gov.in. This is a valuable opportunity for government employment that should not be overlooked!',3,'2025-10-05','2025-11-03','2025-10-05 04:32:15','https://mptgoa.gov.in/','https://mptgoa.gov.in/admin/Careers-document/1759314656605775Recruitment%20Notice%201.10.2025.pdf',0),
(57,'Physical Research Laboratory (PRL) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 20 Positions of Technical Assistant and Technician B','Physical Research Laboratory (PRL)','GJ','Full-time','','Physical Research Laboratory (PRL) is recruiting for 20 positions of Technical Assistant and Technician in 2025. Candidates holding an ITI or Diploma are eligible to apply online. The online application period commences on 04-10-2025 and concludes on 31-10-2025. Applicants must submit their applications online via the RRC NWR website, prl.res.in.',20,'2025-10-05','2025-10-31','2025-10-05 04:35:44','https://www.prl.res.in/OPAR/','https://www.prl.res.in/~notices/websitedocs/2025/10/03/Advt-02-2025-TA-TECH-B-03-10-2025-15-56-22.pdf',0),
(58,'Arogyasathi Gujarat Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 38 Positions Including Taluka Programme Assistant, Medical Officer, and Additional Roles','Arogyasathi Gujarat','GJ','Full-time','','Arogyasathi Gujarat Recruitment 2025 for 38 vacancies in the positions of Taluka Programme Assistant, Medical Officer, and more. This is an excellent opportunity for those with relevant qualifications.\n\nEligible candidates with degrees in Graduate, B.Com, MBBS, Diploma, BSW, M.Com, MSW, and ANM are encouraged to apply online. The online application process will commence on November 29, 2025, and will close on November 8, 2025.\n\nTo apply, please visit the Arogyasathi Gujarat official website at arogyasathi.gujarat.gov.in\n',38,'2025-10-05','2025-11-08','2025-10-05 04:39:59','https://arogyasathi.gujarat.gov.in/CurrentOpenings.aspx','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/10/481592-68e0ae3136e4014083255.pdf',0),
(59,'GPSC State Tax Inspector Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 323 Positions','Gujarat Public Service Commission (GPSC)','GJ','Full-time','','information regarding the upcoming Gujarat Public Service Commission (GPSC) Recruitment for the year 2025.\n\nThe GPSC is inviting applications for 323 posts of State Tax Inspector. This opportunity is open to candidates who hold a Bachelor’s degree. \n\nKey dates to remember:\n- **Application Opening Date:** 03-10-2025 \n- **Application Closing Date:** 17-10-2025 \n\nCandidates are required to apply online through the official GPSC website: [gpsc.gujarat.gov.in](http://gpsc.gujarat.gov.in)\n\nPlease let me know if you need further details or assistance regarding the application process.\n',323,'2025-10-05','2025-10-17','2025-10-05 04:43:10','https://gpsc.gujarat.gov.in/','https://gpsc.gujarat.gov.in/Documents/AdvertismentDocument/DA-27-202526.pdf',0),
(60,'Gujarat Subordinate Services Selection Board (GSSSB) State Tax Inspector Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 323 Positions','Gujarat Subordinate Services Selection Board (GSSSB)','GJ','Full-time','','announce that the Gujarat Subordinate Services Selection Board (GSSSB) will be conducting recruitment for 21 posts of Dental Technician in 2025. \n\nKey details are as follows:\n- **Positions Available:** 21 Dental Technician Posts\n- **Eligibility:** Candidates with a Diploma can apply.\n- **Application Process:** Online applications are to be submitted through the GSSSB website.\n- **Application Timeline:** \n  - **Opening Date:** 01-10-2025\n  - **Closing Date:** 15-10-2025\n\nWe encourage all eligible candidates to visit the GSSSB website at gsssb.gujarat.gov.in to complete their application during the provided dates. \n\nBest of luck to all applicants!',21,'2025-10-05','2025-10-15','2025-10-05 04:45:07','https://ojas.gujarat.gov.in/','https://gsssb.gujarat.gov.in/ViewFile?fileName=E8JD0MnidKI8oJTqFqMfUJer8g8xyzND70FFBFUupYvA4vRjeiJ2m55ewcT4T8Lae341HUIfzG7W5dRnlw96GFbTIKDwymgMbeC7SZZFNLGpP2y5Df8Af9jwPoI1tv%E2%9C%A43xs2S1HslfxIXkBgJrPdQwg%E2%99%AC%E2%99%AC',0),
(61,'Haryana Kaushal Rozgar Nigam Panchkula Panchakarma Technician Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 10 Positions','Haryana Kaushal Rozgar Nigam Panchkula','HR','Full-time','','Haryana Kaushal Rozgar Nigam (HKRN) recruitment for 2025. There are 10 vacancies available for the position of Panchakarma Technician. \n\nEligibility criteria include candidates with a Diploma, 12th, 10th grade, or a B.Voc degree. The application period is from 01st October to 05th October. Interested applicants can apply online at [hkrnl.itiharyana.gov.in](http://hkrnl.itiharyana.gov.in).\n\nPlease share this information with anyone who might be interested in applying. ',10,'2025-10-05','2025-10-05','2025-10-05 04:48:36','https://hkrnl.itiharyana.gov.in/getMember_pub','https://hkrnl.itiharyana.gov.in/RegisterCompanyDocuments/PANCHAKARMA_TECHNICIAN_30490.pdf',0),
(62,'National Brain Research Centre (NBRC) Research Assistant III Recruitment 2025 - Submit Applications Offline for 01 Position','National Brain Research Centre (NBRC)','HR','Full-time','','recent recruitment notification released by the National Brain Research Centre (NBRC) for the position of Research Assistant III. \n\n(nbrc research assistant iii recruitment)\n(Central Govt. Letest Job)\n\nThey are looking to fill 01 position, and interested candidates who meet the eligibility criteria are encouraged to apply. The application must be submitted offline through the official NBRC website. Please note that the last date to submit the application form is 10-10-2025.\n\nIf you know someone who might be interested in this opportunity, please share this information with them. \n',1,'2025-11-05','2025-11-10','2025-10-05 04:53:04','https://www.nbrc.ac.in/newweb/','https://www.nbrc.ac.in/newweb/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Dr-Ellora-lab-RA.pdf',0),
(63,'Urban Local Bodies Department Haryana (ULB Haryana) Engineering Associates Recruitment 2025 - Apply Online for 300 Posts','Urban Local Bodies Department Haryana (ULB Haryana)','HR','Full-time','','opportunity with the Urban Local Bodies Department of Haryana (ULB Haryana). \n\nThey are currently inviting applications for 300 Engineering Associates positions. If you or anyone you know might be interested, the application window is open from September 17 to October 31, 2025. The eligibility requirements are a B.Tech/B.E. or M.Sc. \n\nFor more information and to apply, you can visit the official website at ulbharyana.gov.in',300,'2025-10-05','2025-10-31','2025-10-05 05:00:52','https://https//ulbharyana.gov.in/recruitment','https://ulbharyana.gov.in/Website/DirectorateofUrbanLocalBodies/Images/6496126f-aacd-4176-9b98-25470a2f74ed.pdf',0),
(64,'NHIDCL Deputy Manager Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 34 Positions by November 03','National Highways and Infrastructure Development Corporation (NHIDCL)','HP','Full-time','','National Highways and Infrastructure Development Corporation (NHIDCL) has announced a recruitment drive for 34 posts of Deputy Manager. This opportunity is open for candidates who hold a B.Tech or B.E degree.\n\nKey Details:\n- **Application Start Date:** 04-10-2025  \n- **Application End Date:** 03-11-2025  \n- **Application Process:** Candidates must apply online through the official NHIDCL website: [nhidcl.com](http://nhidcl.com)\n\nIf you meet the qualifications and are interested, please ensure to submit your application within the specified dates.\n',34,'2025-10-05','2025-11-03','2025-10-05 05:04:52','https://www.nhidcl.com/','https://www.nhidcl.com/sites/default/files/2025-09/final_hindi_advertisement_dm_tech._19.9.25.pdf',0),
(65,'Himachal Pradesh State Electricity Board (HPSEBL) Apprentices Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 45 Positions by October 21','Himachal Pradesh State Electricity Board (HPSEBL)','HP','Full-time','','upcoming recruitment by the Himachal Pradesh State Electricity Board (HPSEBL) for 45 positions of Apprentices.\n\nCandidates holding qualifications such as B.Com, B.Tech/B.E, LLB, CA, ICWA, M.Com, or MBA/PGDM are eligible to apply online. The online application process will begin on 26th September 2025 and will close on 21st October 2025. \n\nInterested candidates should visit the official HPSEBL website at hpseb.in to submit their applications.\n\nPlease feel free to share this information with anyone who may be interested.',45,'2025-10-05','2025-10-21','2025-10-05 05:07:09','https://www.hpseb.in/irj/go/km/docs/internet/New_Website/Pages/Home.html','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/09/55656664-68d75b729d02c89625833.pdf',0),
(66,'JKSSB has announced vacancies for Junior Assistant, Junior Scale Stenographer, and other positions for the year 2025 – Submit your online application for 361 available posts','Jammu and Kashmir Services Selection Board (JKSSB)','AP','Full-time','','recruitment notification released by the Jammu and Kashmir Services Selection Board (JKSSB). They have announced 361 vacancies for the positions of Junior Assistant, Junior Scale Stenographer, and other roles. \n\nEligible candidates with a graduate degree can apply online through the official website at jkssb.nic.in starting from 10th October 2025 until 18th November 2025. \n\nPlease let me know if you need any more details or assistance regarding the application process.',361,'2025-10-05','2025-11-18','2025-10-05 05:26:23','https://jkssb.nic.in/','https://jkssb.nic.in/Pdf/ADVT08OF2025_27092025.pdf',0),
(67,'Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission (JSSC) Assistant Jailor Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 45 Positions','Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission (JSSC)','JH','Full-time','','mportant information regarding the upcoming recruitment by the Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission (JSSC) in 2025. \n\nThe JSSC is inviting applications for 45 posts of Assistant Jailor. Candidates who have completed their graduation are eligible to apply. The online application process will commence on November 7, 2025, and will close on December 8, 2025.\n\nInterested candidates are required to apply through the official JSSC website: [jssc.jharkhand.gov.in](http://jssc.jharkhand.gov.in).\n\nPlease feel free to share this information with any potential candidates who may be interested.',45,'2025-10-05','2025-12-08','2025-10-05 05:28:34','https://jssc.jharkhand.gov.in/','https://jssc.jharkhand.gov.in/sites/default/files/JAJCE-2025%20Adv.%20Regular.pdf',0),
(68,'Jharkhand Home Guard Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 510 Positions','Jharkhand Home Guard','JH','Full-time','','Jharkhand Home Guard Recruitment for the year 2025. There are 510 posts available for the Home Guard positions, and candidates who have completed 10th or 7th grade are eligible to apply.\n\nThe online application process will commence on 24th October 2025 and will close on 7th November 2025. Interested candidates can apply through the official website of the Jharkhand Home Guard at simdega.nic.in.\n\nPlease share this information with anyone who might be interested in applying.\n',510,'2025-10-05','2025-11-07','2025-10-05 05:30:49','https://https//japit.jharkhand.gov.in/','https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s30fcbc61acd0479dc77e3cccc0f5ffca7/uploads/2025/09/17582807209799.pdf',0),
(69,'SSC CPO Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 2861','Staff Selection Commission (SSC)','AP','Full-time','','Staff Selection Commission (SSC) is recruiting for 2861 posts of Sub Inspector in 2025. If you hold any Bachelor\'s degree, you are eligible to apply for this opportunity.\n\nThe online application process will commence on 26th September 2025 and will remain open until 16th October 2025. To apply, please visit the official SSC website at ssc.gov.in.\n\nEnsure that you complete your application within the specified dates to be considered for the selection process.\n\nBest of luck to all applicants!\n',2861,'2025-10-05','2025-10-16','2025-10-05 05:33:58','https://ssc.gov.in/','https://ssc.gov.in/api/attachment/uploads/masterData/NoticeBoards/Notice_of_adv_capf_2025.pdf',0),
(70,'Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission (JSSC) Warder Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 1733 Positions','Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission (JSSC)','JH','Full-time','','Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission (JSSC). The recruitment for 1733 posts of Warder has been announced, and candidates who have completed their 10th grade are invited to apply online.\n\nKey details are as follows:\n- **Application Opening Date:** 07-11-2025  \n- **Application Closing Date:** 08-12-2025  \n- **How to Apply:** Candidates can apply online through the official JSSC website: [jssc.jharkhand.gov.in](https://jssc.jharkhand.gov.in)\n\nThis could be a fantastic opportunity for those qualified. Please share this information with anyone who may be interested!\n',1733,'2025-10-05','2025-12-08','2025-10-05 05:36:26','https://jssc.jharkhand.gov.in/','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/09/14646555-68d62e328f2e018187396.pdf',0),
(71,'Centre for Development of Advanced Computing (CDAC) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 646 Positions Including Manager, Project Associate, and Other Roles','Centre for Development of Advanced Computing (CDAC)','KA','Full-time','','Centre for Development of Advanced Computing (CDAC) for 646 various posts, including Manager, Project Associate, and other roles. This is a great opportunity for candidates with qualifications such as B.Tech/B.E, M.E/M.Tech, MCA, M.Phil, and Ph.D.\n\nThe online application process will open on 01-10-2025 and close on 20-10-2025. Interested candidates are encouraged to apply online through the official CDAC website at cdac.in.\n\nPlease feel free to share this information with anyone who might be interested. ',646,'2025-10-05','2025-10-20','2025-10-05 06:25:35','https://careers.cdac.in/','https://careers.cdac.in/',0),
