(89,'InIndian Army, Directorate General of Electronics and Mechanical Engineers (Indian Army DG EME)  Group C Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 194 LDC, Fireman, and Additional Positions','InIndian Army, Directorate General of Electronics and Mechanical Engineers (Indian Army DG EME)','AP','Full-time','','ndian Army Directorate General of Electronics and Mechanical Engineers (DG EME) has released a recruitment notification for various positions including LDC, Fireman, and more. There are a total of 194 vacancies available for eligible candidates who have completed their 10TH, 12TH, or ITI.\n\nThe application process will be conducted offline, and candidates can apply from 04-10-2025 to 24-10-2025 at the official website: indianarmy.nic.in.\n\nThis is a great opportunity for those looking to join the Indian Army. For further details, including eligibility criteria, age limit, salary structure, and selection process, please refer to the official notification.\n\nIf you know anyone who might be interested, feel free to share this information with them!\n',194,'2025-10-05','2025-10-24','2025-10-05 06:43:21','https://indianarmy.nic.in/','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/09/70270589-68db6b6d299ac5179172.pdf',0),
(90,'Mahatma Gandhi University (MGU) Technical Assistant Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Offline for 1 Position','Mahatma Gandhi University (MGU)','KL','Full-time','','notification regarding the recruitment of a Technical Assistant at Mahatma Gandhi University (MGU). The university has announced that they are inviting offline applications for 1 Technical Assistant post. \n\nHere are the key details:\n- **Position**: Technical Assistant\n- **Total Posts**: 01\n- **Eligibility**: Eligible graduates can apply\n- **Application Method**: Offline through the official MGU website\n- **Last Date to Apply**: 17-10-2025\n\nThis could be a great opportunity for anyone looking to start their career in a government role. For further details regarding eligibility criteria, age limit, salary structure, selection process, and a link to the official notification and application form, please check the MGU website at [mgu.ac.in](http://mgu.ac.in).\n\nDon’t miss out on this opportunity!',1,'2025-10-05','2025-10-17','2025-10-05 06:45:57','https://www.mgu.ac.in/home/','https://www.mgu.ac.in/uploads/2025/10/AD_01_2025_26_technical-Assitant.pdf?x23765',0),
