(92,'Indian Institute of Technology Indore (IIT Indore) is seeking applications for the position of Project Associate 1 for the year 2025 - Please apply offline.','Indian Institute of Technology Indore (IIT Indore)','MP','Full-time','','Indian Institute of Technology Indore (IIT Indore) for the position of Project Associate I. The institute is looking to fill 02 positions in this role. Interested and eligible candidates can apply offline through the official IIT Indore website.\n\nPlease note that the last date to submit the application form is 08-10-2025. \n\nIn case you or anyone you know is interested, further details about the eligibility criteria, age limit, salary structure, selection process, application steps, and direct links to the official notification and application form can be found on the IIT Indore website.\n\nFeel free to share this information with potentially interested candidates!\n',2,'2025-10-05','2025-10-08','2025-10-05 06:51:49','https://www.iiti.ac.in/','https://www.iiti.ac.in/public/storage/recruitments/October2025/2wIQsqrZkbit4kov85q7.pdf',0),
(93,'Recruitment for Research Scientist I at AIIMS Bhopal Project 2025 – Walk-in','All India Institute of Medical Sciences Bhopal (AIIMS Bhopal)','MP','Full-time','','All India Institute of Medical Sciences Bhopal (AIIMS Bhopal) is currently recruiting for 02 posts of Project Research Scientist I. This opportunity is open to candidates with any postgraduate degree. \n\nThe walk-in interview will be conducted until 15th October 2025. For more details regarding the position and the application process, please visit the official AIIMS Bhopal website at aiimsbhopal.edu.in.\n',2,'2025-10-05','2025-10-15','2025-10-05 06:56:12','https://aiimsbhopal.edu.in/','https://https//aiimsbhopal.edu.in/AIIMSFiles/career/jonUnderProject/Download/Advt_RA_DoD_Final.pdf',0),
(94,'Homi Bhabha Centre for Science Education (HBCSE) Recruitment 2025 – Walk-in for 12 positions including Library Trainee, Engineer Trainee, and additional roles.','Homi Bhabha Centre for Science Education (HBCSE)','MH','Full-time','','Homi Bhabha Centre for Science Education (HBCSE). They are looking to fill 12 posts, including roles such as Library Trainee, Engineer Trainee, and more. This walk-in recruitment is open to candidates with various qualifications, including Any Graduate, B.Sc, B.Tech/B.E, Diploma, B.Lib, M.Sc, MS, and BS.\n\n**Key Details:**\n- **Walk-in Dates:** 27-10-2025 to 10-11-2025\n- **Maximum Age Limit:** 28 - 31 Years\n- **Application Fee:** Not mentioned in the announcement.\n\n### Vacancy Breakdown:\n- Project Scientific Officer - B: 01\n- Project Scientific Assistant - B: 03\n- Project Assistant: 02\n- Project Work Assistant: 01\n- Engineer Trainee (IT): 02\n- Technical Trainee (Electrical/Civil): 03\n- Library Trainee: 01\n\nFor more detailed information, please visit the HBCSE official website: (http://hbcse.tifr.res.in)\n\nIf you or anyone you know may be interested, please feel free to share this information. ',12,'2025-10-05','2025-10-10','2025-10-05 06:59:15','https://hbcse.tifr.res.in/','https://www.hbcse.tifr.res.in/get-involved/work-at-hbcse/temp-advt_04-2025.pdf',0),
(95,'Women and Child Development Odisha (WCD Odisha)  Anganwadi Helper Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 13 Positions','Women and Child Development Odisha (WCD Odisha) ','OD','Full-time','','Women and Child Development Odisha (WCD Odisha) for 13 Anganwadi Helper posts. Interested and eligible candidates are invited to apply online through the official WCD Odisha website, with the application window open from October 4 to October 18, 2025.\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\n- Educational Qualification: 12th Grade or equivalent\n\n**For Further Details:**\nYou can find complete information regarding the eligibility criteria, age limit, salary structure, selection process, application steps, and direct links to the official notification and online application form on the WCD Odisha website: [awc.odisha.gov.in](http://awc.odisha.gov.in).\n\nPlease spread the word to anyone who may be interested. ',13,'2025-10-05','2025-10-18','2025-10-05 07:27:17','https://engagement-awc.odisha.gov.in/wcdUserlogin','https://engagement-awc.odisha.gov.in/download-aww-event-document?awwEventHistoryId=145300',0),
(96,'Indian Institute of Science Education and Research Berhampur (IISER Berhampur) Faculty Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 42 Positions','Indian Institute of Science Education and Research Berhampur (IISER Berhampur)','OD','Full-time','','Indian Institute of Science Education and Research Berhampur (IISER Berhampur) for the recruitment of 42 Faculty positions. If you have an M.Phil or Ph.D., you are eligible to apply!\n\n**Key Details:**  \n- **No of Posts:** 42  \n- **Positions Available:**  \n  - Assistant Professor: 31  \n  - Associate Professor: 10  \n  - Professor: 01  \n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs. 1,01,500 - 1,59,100  \n- **Application Mode:** Online  \n- **Start Date:** 19th September 2025  \n- **Last Date:** 20th October 2025  \n- **Website:** [iiserbpr.ac.in](http://iiserbpr.ac.in)  \n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \n- For Professors, a Ph.D. with 10 years of relevant post-PhD research and teaching experience is required.  \n- For Associate Professors, a Ph.D. with 6 years of teaching/research experience is needed.  \n- For Assistant Professors, a Ph.D. with 3 years of industrial/research/teaching experience is essential.\n\n**How to Apply:**  \nPlease submit your application online along with supporting documents by the specified deadline. Make sure to check that your email is active, as all further instructions for shortlisted candidates will be communicated via email.\n\nIf you have any questions or need assistance, please reach out to the helpdesk at helpdesk@iiserbpr.ac.in.\n',42,'2025-10-05','2025-10-20','2025-10-05 07:31:36','https://https//fr.iiserbpr.ac.in/','https://www.iiserbpr.ac.in/webcontrol/uploads/job/IISERBPR_DOFA_2025_02Advertisement_20250918135014_7587.pdf',0),
(97,'Tata Memorial Centre (TMC) is recruiting for 02 positions of Assistant in 2025.','Tata Memorial Centre (TMC) ','PB','Full-time','','Tata Memorial Centre (TMC) for the position of Assistant. \n\nTMC is looking to fill 02 posts for this role, specifically seeking individuals with a background in B.Com, CA, M.Com, or MBA/PGDM. The Walk-in Interview is scheduled for 10th October 2025. For more details, please visit the official TMC website at tmc.gov.in.\n\n**Key Information**:\n- **Application Fee**: Not Mentioned.\n- **Important Dates**: Date of Walkin Interview: 10-10-2025\n- **Age Limit**: Up to 30 Years\n- **Qualifications**: B.Com/M.Com with 2 years of experience in an accounts department, preferably in payroll processing. Preference will be given to candidates with MBA (Finance), CA (Inter), or ICWA (Inter).\n- **Salary**: Rs. 25,510/-\n\nShould you know anyone who fits the criteria, please do pass this information along.',2,'2025-10-05','2025-10-10','2025-10-05 07:35:27','https://tmc.gov.in/','https://tmc.gov.in/m_events/events/JobDetail?jobId=36295',0),
(98,'SBI Specialist Officers Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Online Application for Manager Positions by October 15','State Bank of India (SBI)','AP','Full-time','','SBI Specialist Officers Recruitment 2025. The State Bank of India is looking to fill 122 posts for various specialist officer positions, including Manager roles.\n\nHere are the key details:\n- **Application Dates:** 11th September 2025 - 15th October 2025\n- **Salary Range:** ₹64,820 - ₹1,05,280\n- **Eligibility:** Candidates may apply if they hold qualifications such as Any Graduate, B.Tech/B.E, CA, ICWA, MBA/PGDM, MCA, PGDBM, PGDBA. \n- **Age Limit:** \n  - Manager: 28-35 years \n  - Deputy Manager: 25-32 years \n  - Manager (Credit Analyst): 25-35 years\n- **Application Fee:** \n  - General/EWS/OBC candidates: ₹750/- \n  - SC/ST/PwBD candidates: NIL \n\nIf you meet the eligibility criteria, I encourage you to apply through the SBI website at sbi.bank.in.',122,'2025-10-06','2025-10-15','2025-10-06 11:53:31','https://recruitment.sbi.bank.in/crpd-sco-2025-26--11/apply','https://sbi.bank.in/web/careers/current-openings',0),
(99,'EMRS Non-Teaching Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 1620 Positions Including Accountant, JSA, and Other Roles','Eklavya Model Residential Schools (EMRS)','AP','Full-time','','Eklavya Model Residential Schools (EMRS) is set to recruit for 1620 Non-Teaching positions in 2025. Candidates who have completed Any Graduate or 10TH can submit their applications online. The online application process will commence shortly and will conclude on 23-10-2025. Applicants must apply through the EMRS website at nests.tribal.gov.in.\n\nThe National Education Society for Tribal Students (NESTS) has issued an official notification regarding the recruitment of 1620 Non-Teaching positions. Interested and qualified candidates are invited to apply online via the official EMRS website. The deadline for submitting the application form is 23-10-2025. This article provides comprehensive details about the EMRS Non-Teaching recruitment, including eligibility criteria, age restrictions, salary structure, selection process, application procedures, and direct links to the official notification and online application form.\n\nCompany Name: Eklavya Model Residential Schools (EMRS)\nPost Name: Non-Teaching Vacancy\nNumber of Posts: 1620\nPay Matrix: Rs 18,000 to 1,12,400\nQualification: Any Graduate, 10TH\nAge Limit: 18 to 35 years\nAdvt No: NESTS/Adv/2025/01\nLast Date for Online Application: 23-10-2025\nOfficial Website: nests.tribal.gov.in\n\nEMRS Non-Teaching Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details:\nName of the Post: Number of Posts\nFemale Staff Nurse: 550\nHostel Warden (Male): 346\nHostel Warden (Female): 289\nAccountant: 61\nJunior Secretariat Assistant: 228\nLab Attendant: 146\n\nEligibility Criteria:\nPrincipal: A Master’s Degree from a recognized institution with a minimum of 50% marks. A Bachelor’s Degree in Education (B.Ed.) from an NCTE recognized institution with at least 50% marks. A three-year integrated B.Ed.-M.Ed. from an NCTE recognized institution with a minimum of 50% marks, or a four-year integrated graduation degree with at least 50% marks from an NCTE recognized institution, including the B.Ed. component.\nPost Graduate Teachers (PGTs): An M.Sc. (Computer Science / IT) / MCA/ M.E. or M. Tech. (Computer Science / IT) from a recognized institution with a minimum of 50% marks in aggregate.\nTGTs: An Integrated Post Graduate Course from an NCTE recognized institution in the relevant subject.',1620,'2025-10-06','2025-10-23','2025-10-06 11:58:26','https://examinationservices.nic.in/recSys2025/root/Home.aspx?enc=Ei4cajBkK1gZSfgr53ImFZ5JDNNIP7I8JbNwGOl976uPeIvr9X7G7iVESmo7y1L6','https://nests.tribal.gov.in/WriteReadData/RTF1984/1758792855.pdf',0),
(100,'North Central Railway (RRC NCR) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 46 Positions under the Sports Quota','North Central Railway (RRC NCR)','AP','Full-time','','North Central Railway (RRC NCR) Recruitment 2025 for 46 posts of Sports Quota. If you or someone you know may be interested, here are the key points:\n\n- **Post Name**: Sports Quota  \n- **Number of Posts**: 46  \n- **Qualifications**: Graduate, ITI, 12TH, 10TH  \n- **Age Limit**: 18 to 25 years  \n- **Start Date for Online Application**: 03-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Online Application**: 02-11-2025  \n- **Official Website**: [rrcpryj.org](http://rrcpryj.org)\n\nThe recruitment covers a variety of sports, and the specific vacancy details can be found in the official notification. I recommend reviewing the eligibility criteria and other details before applying',46,'2025-10-06','2025-11-02','2025-10-06 12:01:19','https://www.rrcpryj.org/','https://www.rrcpryj.org/doc/36413123Notificatio%20for%20Sports%20Quota%202025-26.pdf',0),
(101,'Women and Child Development Corporation Bihar (WCDC Bihar) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 195 Positions Including Office Assistant, Multi-Purpose Staff, and Additional Roles','Women and Child Development Corporation Bihar (WCDC Bihar)','BR','Full-time','','Women and Child Development Corporation Bihar (WCDC Bihar) has officially announced the recruitment for 195 positions, including Office Assistant, Multi Purpose Staff, and more, with applications now open until October 27, 2025.\n\n**Recruitment Details:**\n- **Post Names:** Office Assistant, Multi Purpose Staff, and others\n- **Total Posts:** 195\n- **Qualifications Required:** B.A, B.Sc, LLB, Diploma, 10TH, LLM, M.A, M.Sc\n- **Age Limit:** 37 to 42 years (varies by category)\n- **Application Start Date:** October 6, 2025\n- **Application Last Date:** October 27, 2025\n- **Official Website:** [miswcdc.bihar.gov.in](http://miswcdc.bihar.gov.in)\n\nThis is a fantastic chance for eligible graduates to apply online. Please make sure to check the eligibility criteria, age limits, and the application procedure outlined in the official notification.\n\nDon’t miss out on this opportunity to advance your career in public service. Feel free to share this information with anyone who might be interested.',195,'2025-10-06','2025-10-27','2025-10-06 12:04:44','https://miswcdc.bihar.gov.in/publicweb/BeforeFillingApplication.aspx?AFRID=9','https://miswcdc.bihar.gov.in/SysAdmin/HRM/Documents/Advertisements/20251006101535.pdf',0),
(102,'Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC) Dental Hygienist Recruitment 2025 (Short Notice) - Submit Your Application Online for 702 Positions','Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC)','BR','Full-time','','Dental Hygienists by the Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC). The commission has officially released a notification for 702 vacancies for the position of Dental Hygienist.\n\nHere are the key details:\n- **Company Name:** Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC)\n- **Post Name:** Dental Hygienist\n- **Number of Posts:** 702\n- **Qualification:** Diploma in Dental Hygiene\n- **Start Date for Apply Online:** 10-10-2025\n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 10-11-2025\n- **Official Website:** [btsc.bihar.gov.in](http://btsc.bihar.gov.in)\n\nCandidates interested in applying should meet the eligibility criteria as specified in the official notification. It is also important to note that the pay matrix, age limits, and application fee details will be available soon.',702,'2025-10-06','2025-10-10','2025-10-06 12:09:58','https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/','https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/sites/default/files/circulars/3203.pdf',0),
(103,'Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC)  Hostel Manager Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 91 Positions','Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC)  ','BR','Full-time','','Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC) has announced the recruitment for 91 Hostel Manager posts for the year 2025.\n\n**Details of the Recruitment:**\n- **Company Name:** Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC)  \n- **Post Name:** Hostel Manager  \n- **Number of Posts:** 91  \n- **Start Date for Apply Online:** 10-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 10-11-2025  \n- **Official Website:** [btsc.bihar.gov.in](http://btsc.bihar.gov.in)  \n\nInterested and eligible candidates can apply online through the official BTSC website. Make sure to check out the eligibility criteria, age limits, salary structure, and selection process before applying. This is a fantastic chance to secure a position in the government sector.\n\nDon’t miss this opportunity to apply before the deadline! ',91,'2025-10-06','2025-11-10','2025-10-06 12:14:00','https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/','https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/sites/default/files/circulars/3204.pdf',0),
(104,'Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC) Junior Engineer Recruitment 2025 (Brief Notice) - Submit Your Application Online for 2747 Positions','Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC)','BR','Full-time','','Bihar Technical Service Commission (BTSC) for the position of Junior Engineer. There are a total of 2747 vacancies available for this post. Interested candidates who hold a B.E/B.Tech degree or a Diploma in Engineering are encouraged to apply online.  \n\nHere are the key details regarding this recruitment:  \n- **Post Name:** Junior Engineer  \n- **Total Vacancies:** 2747  \n- **Eligibility:** B.Tech/B.E, Diploma in Civil/Electrical/Mechanical Engineering  \n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 37 years with age relaxation as per rules  \n- **Monthly Pay:** Rs 35400  \n- **Application Fee:** Rs 100 for all candidates  \n- **Online Application Start Date:** 15-10-2025  \n- **Online Application End Date:** 15-11-2025  \n- **Official Website:** [btsc.bihar.gov.in](https://btsc.bihar.gov.in)\n\nCandidates can apply directly through the BTSC website during the application period. For further information regarding eligibility criteria, selection process, and application procedure, please refer to the official notification on the BTSC website.\n\nPlease feel free to share this information with anyone who may be interested.  ',2747,'2025-10-06','2025-11-15','2025-10-06 12:16:34','https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/','https://btsc.bihar.gov.in/sites/default/files/circulars/3206.pdf',0),
(105,'Border Roads Organization (BRO) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 542 MSW and Vehicle Mechanic Positions','Border Roads Organization (BRO)','AP','Full-time','','Border Roads Organisation (BRO) for various posts, including 542 vacancies for MSW and Vehicle Mechanic roles. \n\nHere are the key details:\n\n- **Company Name**: Border Roads Organisation (BRO)\n- **Post Names**: MSW (Painter, DES), Vehicle Mechanic\n- **Total Vacancies**: 542\n- **Eligibility**: ITI, 10TH Pass\n- **Age Limit**: 18 to 25 years (age relaxation as per rules)\n- **Pay Scale**: Rs. 18000-63200\n- **Application Fee**: Rs. 50 for General/OBC/EWS; Free for SC/ST/PwD\n- **Application Start Date**: 11-10-2025\n- **Application End Date**: 24-11-2025\n- **Official Website**: [bro.gov.in](http://bro.gov.in)\n\nI encourage interested and eligible candidates to ensure they submit their applications offline before the deadline. For more information regarding eligibility criteria, selection process, and application steps, candidates can refer to the official notification on the BRO website.\n\nFeel free to forward this information to any potential candidates or others who might benefit from it.\n',542,'2025-10-07','2025-11-24','2025-10-07 11:54:27','https://bro.gov.in/','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/10/020205545-68e36c054cacb80780622.pdf',0),
(106,'Indian Army DG EME Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 69 LDC, MTS, and Additional Positions','Indian Army Directorate General of Electronics and Mechanical Engineers (Indian Army DG EME)','AP','Full-time','','Indian Army Directorate General of Electronics and Mechanical Engineers (DG EME) for various posts including Lower Division Clerk (LDC), Multi-Tasking Staff (MTS), and others. \n\nHere are the key details:\n\n- **Positions Available**: 69 (including LDC, MTS, and More)\n- **Qualifications**: B.Sc, Diploma, 12th, 10th passed candidates are eligible.\n- **Age Limit**: 18 to 30 years depending on the specific post.\n- **Application Dates**: The application process is open from 11th October 2025 to 14th November 2025.\n- **Selection Process**: It includes a written test administered via OMR, followed by skill and physical tests where applicable.\n- **How to Apply**: Candidates must submit their application offline through the prescribed format mentioned in the official notification.\n\nPotential candidates can find more details and apply through the official Indian Army DG EME website: [indianarmy.nic.in](https://indianarmy.nic.in).\n\nIf you know anyone who might be interested or need further information, feel free to reach out.\n',69,'2025-10-07','2025-11-14','2025-10-07 11:56:58','https://indianarmy.nic.in/','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/10/55648454-68e490ebd788820122213.pdf',0),
(107,'AIIMS Raipur Faculty Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 110 Positions','All India Institute of Medical Sciences Raipur (AIIMS Raipur)','CG','Full-time','','All India Institute of Medical Sciences Raipur (AIIMS Raipur). They have officially released a notification for the recruitment of 110 Faculty Posts, inviting eligible candidates to apply online. \n\nHere are some key details about the recruitment:\n\n- **Company Name:** All India Institute of Medical Sciences Raipur (AIIMS Raipur)\n- **Post Name:** Faculty\n- **No of Posts:** 110\n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs. 101500-220400\n- **Qualification:** DNB, M.Sc, MS/MD, M.Ch, DM\n- **Age Limit:** 58 years \n- **Start Date for Apply Online:** 10-10-2025\n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 05-11-2025\n- **Official Website:** [aiimsraipur.edu.in](http://aiimsraipur.edu.in)\n\nFor those interested in applying, it’s important to check the eligibility criteria, age limit, and selection process outlined in the official notification. Don’t miss this opportunity to be part of such a prestigious institution! ',110,'2025-10-07','2025-11-05','2025-10-07 12:02:17','https://www.aiimsraipur.edu.in/','https://www.aiimsraipur.edu.in/upload/vacancies/68e3a98657601_Final%20Faculty%20Rolling%20Advt%2006.10.2025.pdf',0),
(108,'Department of School Education Chhattisgarh Special Educator Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 100 Positions','Department of School Education Chhattisgarh','CG','Full-time','','Department of School Education Chhattisgarh is seeking to fill 100 positions for Special Educators through offline applications.\n\n**Details of the Recruitment:**\n- **Position:** Special Educator  \n- **Number of Posts:** 100  \n- **Age Limit:** 21 to 35 years (Age relaxation as per rules)\n- **Application Start Date:** 07-10-2025  \n- **Application End Date:** 13-10-2025  \n- **Official Website:** [eduportal.cg.nic.in](http://eduportal.cg.nic.in)  \n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \nCandidates are advised to refer to the official notification for specific eligibility details.\n\n**Application Process:**  \nCandidates ready to contribute to the educational sector can apply offline through the official website starting from October 7, 2025, to October 13, 2025. This recruitment pertains to various teaching positions including primary, upper primary, and secondary schools.\n\nWe encourage eligible candidates to take advantage of this opportunity to make a meaningful impact in the educational landscape of Chhattisgarh.',100,'2025-10-07','2025-10-13','2025-10-07 12:04:50','https://eduportal.cg.nic.in/','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/10/2154882-68e490ebd788885417542.pdf',0),
(109,'State Bank of India (SBI) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 10 Positions Including Manager, Deputy Manager, and More','State Bank of India (SBI)','AP','Full-time','','State Bank of India (SBI) regarding the recruitment of Specialist Cadre Officers. They have officially announced 10 vacancies for various positions, including Manager and Deputy Manager.\n\nThe application period will start on October 8, 2025, and will remain open until October 28, 2025. If you\'re interested, you can apply online at sbi.bank.in. \n\nHere are some key details:\n- **Positions Available:** Deputy Manager (Economist), Assistant General Manager (Product & Research - Forex & Rupee Derivatives), Manager (Product & Research - Forex & Rupee Derivatives), and Manager (Research Analyst).\n- **Eligibility:** Candidates with qualifications such as a Master’s degree, CA, MBA/PGDM, or PGDBM are welcome to apply.\n- **Salary Range:** Rs. 64820-135020, depending on the position.\n- **Application Fee:** Rs. 750 for General/EWS/OBC candidates, no fee for SC/ST/PwBD candidates.\n\nFor more detailed information regarding the application steps, eligibility criteria, and pay matrix, I recommend checking the official notification on the SBI website.\n\nIf you have any questions or need further assistance, feel free to reach out.\n',10,'2025-10-08','2025-10-28','2025-10-08 10:35:52','https://recruitment.sbi.bank.in/crpd-sco-2025-26-12/apply','https://sbi.bank.in/documents/77530/52947104/Final_ADV_CRPD_SCO_2025-26_12_ERD.pdf/c29ab890-bef6-e7a2-2efb-a896efc2404b?t=1759902449638',0),
(110,'POWERGRID Apprentices Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 1161 Positions','POWERGRID ','AP','Full-time','','POWERGRID has announced their Apprentices Recruitment 2025, offering 1161 positions across various trades. Interested candidates can apply online from September 15, 2025, until October 12, 2025. The salary ranges from ₹13,500 to ₹17,500 depending on the qualification.\n\nEligibility criteria include candidates with educational backgrounds in B.A., B.Sc., B.Tech/B.E., LLB, Diploma, ITI, and MBA/PGDM. Importantly, there is no application fee required.\n\nFor more details on eligibility, age limits, selection processes, and to apply, please visit the POWERGRID website at powergrid.in.\n',1161,'2025-10-08','2025-10-12','2025-10-08 10:40:28','https://www.apprenticeshipindia.gov.in/','https://www.powergrid.in/en/rolling-advertisement-for-enagagement-of-apprentices',0),
(111,'Prasar Bharati Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 59 Positions Including Broadcast Executive, Copy Writer, and More.','Prasar Bharati','AP','Full-time','','Prasar Bharati for the recruitment of 59 positions, including Broadcast Executives, Copy Writers, and more. \n\n**Important Details:**  \n- **Start Date for Application:** 07 October 2025  \n- **Last Date for Application:** 21 October 2025  \n- **Eligibility:** Graduates, B.Sc holders, 12th pass, PG Diploma holders can apply.  \n- **Salary:** Rs. 25,000 - 80,000  \n- **Official Website for Application:** [prasarbharati.gov.in](https://www.prasarbharati.gov.in)\n\nA detailed notification including eligibility criteria, age limit, selection process, and application steps is available on the official website. Please make sure to check all details and submit your application before the deadline.\n\nLet me know if you need any further information or assistance regarding this recruitment.\n',59,'2025-10-08','2025-10-21','2025-10-08 10:42:56','https://prasarbharati.gov.in/','https://prasarbharati.gov.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/186619-NIA_dtd_07-10-2025-6_RNUs.pdf',0),
(112,'India Post IPPB GDS (in the role of Executive) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 348 Positions','India Post Payments Bank (IPPB)','KA','Full-time','','India Post Payments Bank (IPPB) regarding the recruitment of 348 Gramin Dak Sevaks (as Executive). This is a great opportunity for eligible candidates who have completed their graduation.\n\nHere are some key details about the recruitment:\n- **Post Name**: Gramin Dak Sevaks (as Executive)  \n- **Number of Vacancies**: 348  \n- **Salary**: Rs. 30,000 per month  \n- **Eligibility**: Any Graduate  \n- **Age Limit**: 20 to 35 years  \n- **Application Dates**: From 09-10-2025 to 29-10-2025  \n- **Official Website for Applications**: [ippbonline.com](http://ippbonline.com)\n\nInterested candidates can apply online through the official IPPB website. The last date for submission of applications is 29-10-2025, and it is important to ensure eligibility before applying due to the non-refundable application fee of ₹ 750.\n\nFeel free to reach out if you have any questions or need further information.',348,'2025-10-09','2025-10-29','2025-10-09 09:29:28','https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/ippblaug25/','https://ippbonline.com/documents/20133/133019/1759925784399.pdf',0),
(113,'UPSC Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 213 Positions Including Lecturer, Medical Officer, and More by October 12','Union Public Service Commission','AP','Full-time','',' UPSC Recruitment 2025. There are a total of 213 posts available, including Lecturer, Medical Officer, and more. \n\nKey details are as follows:\n- **Application Opening Date:** 13th September 2025  \n- **Application Closing Date:** 12th October 2025  \n- **Application Fee:** Rs. 25 for all candidates; NIL for SC/ST/PwBD/Women candidates.\n\n### Age Limit:\n- UR Category: 50 Years  \n- OBC Category: 53 Years  \n- SC/ST Category: 55 Years  \n- PwBD Category: 56 Years  \n- EWS Category: 40 Years  \n- UR/EWS Category: 35 Years  \n\n### Qualifications Required:\n- Degree in Law, Post Graduation in Urdu with B.Ed, or recognized MBBS degree.\n- Master\'s Degree in relevant fields such as Social Work, Sociology, Economics, etc. \n\nFor more detailed information regarding eligibility, syllabus, selection process, important dates, and to apply online, please visit the official UPSC website at [upsc.gov.in](http://upsc.gov.in). ',213,'2025-10-09','2025-10-12','2025-10-09 09:32:50','https://upsconline.gov.in/ora/VacancyNoticePub.php','https://upsc.gov.in/sites/default/files/Advt-13-25-ExtnClsngDate-Engl-300925.pdf',0),
(114,'SEBI Officer Grade A (Assistant Manager) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 110 Positions','Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI)','AP','Full-time','','Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI) has announced the recruitment for 2025, offering 110 positions for Officer Grade A (Assistant Manager). Candidates holding a B.A, B.Tech/B.E, any Master\'s degree, or a PG Diploma are eligible to apply online. Applications must be submitted through the SEBI website, sebi.gov.in.\n\nThe Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI) has issued an official notification regarding the recruitment of 110 Officer Grade A (Assistant Manager) positions. Interested and qualified candidates may apply online via the official SEBI website. The deadline for submitting the application form will be updated shortly. This article provides comprehensive details about the SEBI Officer Grade A (Assistant Manager) recruitment, including eligibility criteria, age restrictions, salary structure, selection process, application procedures, and direct links to the official notification and online application form.\n\nCompany Name: Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI)\nPost Name: Officer Grade A (Assistant Manager)\nNumber of Posts: 110\nPay Scale: Rs 62500 to 126100\nQualifications: B.A, B.Tech/B.E, any Master\'s degree, PG Diploma\nAge Limit: None to 30 years\nStart Date for Online Application: Available Soon\nLast Date for Online Application: Available Soon\nOfficial Website: sebi.gov.in\n\nVacancy Details:\nStream: Number of Posts\nGeneral: 56\nLegal: 20\nInformation Technology: 22\nResearch: 4\nOfficial Language: 3\nEngineering (Electrical): 2\nEngineering (Civil): 3\n\nEligibility Criteria:\nStream: Educational Qualification\nGeneral: A Master’s Degree/Post Graduate Diploma (minimum two years’ duration) in any discipline, a Bachelor’s Degree in Law, or a Bachelor’s Degree in Engineering from a recognized University/Institute, or qualifications such as Chartered Accountant, Chartered Financial Analyst, Company Secretary, or Cost Accountant. *(Equivalent to a Master’s Degree in that discipline as recognized by the Association of Indian Universities).\nLegal: Required Educational Qualification - A Bachelor’s Degree in Law from a recognized University/Institute.\nInformation Technology: A Bachelor’s Degree in Engineering in any branch or a Bachelor’s Degree in any discipline.',110,'2025-10-09','2025-11-01','2025-10-09 09:41:52','https://www.sebi.gov.in/','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/10/80236-68e5fe8cb346b52299651.pdf',0),
(115,'Motilal Nehru College is recruiting guest faculty for the year 2025 – Walk-in','Motilal Nehru College Delhi','DL','Full-time','','Motilal Nehru College. We are looking to fill 02 positions in the field of Computer Science. \n\n**Walk-in Interview Details:**  \n- **Date:** 16th October 2025  \n- **Time:** 10:00 A.M.  \n- **Location:** Motilal Nehru College  \n\nPlease ensure that you visit our official website [mlncdu.ac.in](http://mlncdu.ac.in) for detailed information regarding qualifications and other necessary criteria. \n\nWe look forward to your participation.  ',2,'2025-10-09','2025-10-16','2025-10-09 11:54:46','https://mlncdu.ac.in/','http://www.mlncdu.ac.in/pdf/notice081025.pdf',0),
