(127,'Indian Army TGC 143 Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 30 Positions','Indian Army Recruitment','WB','Full-time','','Indian Army for the 143rd Technical Graduate Course (TGC 143) with a total of 30 available positions. If you are a candidate with a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in engineering, this could be a great opportunity for you!\n\n**Key Details:**\n- **Post Name:** 143rd Technical Graduate Course  \n- **No of Posts:** 30  \n- **Pay Matrix:** ₹56,100  \n- **Qualifications Required:** B.E/B.Tech, M.Sc  \n- **Age Limit:** 20 to 27 years (born between 01 Jul 1999 and 30 Jun 2006 inclusive)  \n- **Online Application Start Date:** 08-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Online Applications:** 06-11-2025  \n- **Official Website for Application:** [joinindianarmy.nic.in](https://joinindianarmy.nic.in)\n\nCandidates can apply online through the Indian Army’s official website. Be sure to submit your application before the closing date to be considered.\n\nFor more information on eligibility criteria, age limits, salary structure, and the selection process, please refer to the official notification linked on the website.\n\nBest of luck to all applicants! ',30,'2025-10-09','2025-11-06','2025-10-09 12:10:37','https://joinindianarmy.nic.in/Authentication.aspx','https://www.joinindianarmy.nic.in/writereaddata/Portal/NotificationPDF/TGC-143__NOTIFICATION_HINDI_and_ENGLISH_.pdf',0),
(128,'Medical Education Department AP Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 41 Positions Including Attender, Lab Attendant, and More','Medical Education Department AP','AP','Full-time','','Medical Education Department of Andhra Pradesh. They have officially announced recruitment for a total of 41 positions including Attender, Lab Attendant, and various other posts.\n\nKey details are as follows:\n- **Application Opening Date**: 23rd September 2025  \n- **Application Closing Date**: 11th October 2025  \n- **Eligibility**: Candidates must have any Bachelor’s Degree, Diploma, B.Lib, 10th Pass, PG Diploma, or M.Lib. \n- **Application Fee**:  \n  - For OCs, BCs, EWS, and Ex-servicemen: Rs.300/-  \n  - For SCs, STs & Differently Abled: Rs.100/-  \n- **Vacancy Breakdown**: includes roles for Attenders, Lab Attendants, ECG Technicians, and more.\n- **Salary Range**: varies from Rs.15,000 to Rs.27,045 depending on the position.\n\nCandidates interested in applying can do so offline through the official Medical Education Department AP website at [srikakulam.ap.gov.in](http://srikakulam.ap.gov.in).',41,'2025-10-10','2025-10-11','2025-10-10 09:39:22','https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s3f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd/uploads/2025/09/17585476037356.pdf','https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s3f899139df5e1059396431415e770c6dd/uploads/2025/10/17599962518537.pdf',0),
(129,'Border Security Force (BSF) Constable General Duty Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 391 Positions','Border Security Force (BSF)','AP','Full-time','','Border Security Force (BSF). They have officially announced the recruitment of 391 Constable General Duty posts, which is open for candidates who have completed their 10th grade. \n\nThe online application process starts on October 16, 2025, and will close on November 4, 2025. Interested candidates can submit their applications through the BSF\'s official website at bsf.gov.in.\n\nHere are some key details regarding the recruitment:\n- **Position**: Constable (General Duty)\n- **Total Vacancies**: 391\n- **Pay Scale**: Rs. 21,700-69,100\n- **Age Limit**: 18 to 23 years (with relaxation as per rules)\n- **Application Fee**: General/OBC candidates ₹159, SC/ST candidates are exempted from fees.\n\nCandidates must meet the eligibility criteria, including having matriculation from a recognized board and fulfilling the physical standards established by BSF.\n\nFor more information on the application process, eligibility criteria, selection process, and other relevant details, please refer to the official notification on the BSF website.',391,'2025-10-13','2025-11-04','2025-10-13 10:24:44','https://www.bsf.gov.in/','https://d3t79nicn48uzj.cloudfront.net/bsf/custom/1760334883.pdf',0),
(130,'Delhi State Cancer Institute (DSCI) Recruitment of Senior Residents at DSCI for the year 2025 – Walk-in opportunity for 42 positions.','Delhi State Cancer Institute (DSCI)','DL','Full-time','','Delhi State Cancer Institute (DSCI). They are currently recruiting for 42 posts of Senior Residents for the year 2025. If you hold an MBBS, DNB, or MS/MD, you may be eligible to participate in the walk-in interview scheduled for 16th October 2025, from 10:30 AM to 11:30 AM.\n\nFor more details, please refer to the DSCI official website: health.delhi.gov.in.\n\nHere are some key details:\n- **Application Fee**: Not Mentioned\n- **Age Limit**: Maximum of 45 years\n- **Salary**: Pay Scale as per Pay Matrix Level 11, which is ₹67,700 plus allowances.\n\nThis could be a great opportunity for eligible candidates to further their careers in the medical field. ',42,'2025-10-13','2025-10-16','2025-10-13 10:29:48','https://health.delhi.gov.in/','https://health.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/Health/circulars-orders/wdsci_14.pdf',0),
(131,'Ministry of Corporate Affairs (MCA) Young Professionals Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 145 Positions','Ministry of Corporate Affairs (MCA)','HR','Full-time','','Ministry of Corporate Affairs (MCA) regarding the recruitment of 145 Young Professionals. If you or someone you know might be interested, here are some key details:\n\n- **Position**: Young Professionals/ Assistant Young Professionals \n- **Total Vacancies**: 145 \n- **Pay Scale**: Rs. 40,000 - 85,000 \n- **Qualifications**: Candidates must be members of ICAI, ICSI or ICoAI (ICMAI). \n- **Age Limit**: Candidates should not exceed 35 years of age as on 30-10-2025. \n- **Last Date to Apply**: 30-10-2025 \n- **Official Website**: [icai.org](http://icai.org) \n\nThe selection process will be merit-based through the respective Professional Institutes. Candidates with strong communication and analytical skills, as well as good knowledge of technology, are highly valued. \n\nIf you have any questions or need further information, please feel free to reach out.',145,'2025-10-13','2025-10-30','2025-10-13 10:32:44','https://www.icai.org/post/career-in-icai','https://resource.cdn.icai.org/88792icai-mca-yp.pdf',0),
(132,'All India Institute of Medical Sciences Bhopal(AIIMS Bhopal) Project Technical Support Staff-II Recruitments - 2025 – Walk-in for -10 Positions','All India Institute of Medical Sciences Bhopal(AIIMS Bhopal)','MP','Full-time','','All India Institute of Medical Sciences Bhopal(AIIMS Bhopal).\n\nWe invite applications from eligible candidates for the Walk-in Interview scheduled on 03-11-2025.\n\n**Vacancies:** - 10 posts\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\n- **Qualifications:**\n  - Any Graduate  \n  - DMLT  \n  - MLT  \n- **Experience Required:**  \n    - 12th in Science + Diploma (MLT/DMLT/Engineering or equivalent) + Five Years Experience in relevant subject/field or \n    - Three Years Graduate degree in relevant subject/field + two years’ experience in relevant subject.\n- **Age Limit:** Maximum Age Limit: 30 Years\n\n**Salary:**\nThe selected candidates will receive a monthly salary of Rs. 20,000/- plus 20% HRA, totaling to Rs. 24,000/-. \n\n**Application Fee:** NIL\n\nFor detailed information, please visit the official AIIMS Bhopal website: [aiimsbhopal.edu.in](http://aiimsbhopal.edu.in).\n\nWe look forward to your participation in the recruitment process.',10,'2025-10-13','2025-10-03','2025-10-13 10:36:34','https://aiimsbhopal.edu.in/','https://aiimsbhopal.edu.in/AIIMSFiles/career/jonUnderProject/Download/Advertisement%20for%20Recruitment%20to%20Project%20Posts-11102025.pdf',0),
(133,'All India Institute of Medical Sciences Bhopal (AIIMS Bhopal) Project Technical Support Staff - II Recruitment - 2025 – Walk-in for -10 Positions','All India Institute of Medical Sciences Bhopal (AIIMS Bhopal)','MP','Full-time','','All India Institute of Medical Sciences Bhopal (AIIMS Bhopal). We invite applications from eligible candidates for the Walk-in Interview scheduled on 03-11-2025.\n\n**Vacancies:** 10 posts\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\n- **Qualifications:**\n  - Any Graduate  \n  - DMLT  \n  - MLT  \n- **Experience Required:**  \n    - 12th in Science + Diploma (MLT/DMLT/Engineering or equivalent) + Five Years Experience in relevant subject/field or \n    - Three Years Graduate degree in relevant subject/field + two years’ experience in relevant subject.\n- **Age Limit:** Maximum Age Limit: 30 Years\n\n**Salary:**\nThe selected candidates will receive a monthly salary of Rs. 20,000/- plus 20% HRA, totaling to Rs. 24,000/-. \n\n**Application Fee:** NIL\n\nFor detailed information, please visit the official AIIMS Bhopal website: [aiimsbhopal.edu.in](http://aiimsbhopal.edu.in).\n\nWe look forward to your participation in the recruitment process.',10,'2025-10-13','2025-10-03','2025-10-13 10:36:34','https://aiimsbhopal.edu.in/','https://aiimsbhopal.edu.in/AIIMSFiles/career/jonUnderProject/Download/Advertisement%20for%20Recruitment%20to%20Project%20Posts-11102025.pdf',0),
(134,'Employees State Insurance Corporation(ESIC) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for - 67 Positions of Teaching Faculty and Senior Residents','Employees State Insurance Corporation(ESIC)','MP','Full-time','','Employees State Insurance Corporation(ESIC)\n\nESIC Medical College and Hospital (ESIC) has announced the Recruitment Notification for 2025, offering 67 vacancies for Teaching Faculty and Senior Residents. \n\n**Details of the Recruitment are as follows:**  \n- **Post Name:** Teaching Faculty/ Senior Residents  \n- **No of Posts:** 67  \n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs. 67,700-1,23,100  \n- **Qualification:** MBBS, M.Phil/Ph.D, MS/MD  \n- **Age Limit:** 45 and 69 years  \n- **Application Start Date:** 11-10-2025  \n- **Application End Date:** 21-10-2025  \n- **Official Website:** [esic.gov.in](http://esic.gov.in)  \n\n**Vacancy Details:**  \n- **Professor:** 10  \n- **Associate Professor:** 20  \n- **Assistant Professor:** 15  \n- **Senior Residents:** 22  \n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \n- Candidates should possess MBBS, M.Phil/Ph.D, MS/MD in relevant fields.  \n- Age limits as on 21-10-2025: Senior Residents - 45 years; Teaching Faculty - 69 years. Age relaxation as per rules is applicable.  \n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- SC/ST/ESIC Regular Employee, Defence Ex-servicemen/ PH Candidates: NIL  \n- All Other Categories: Rs. 500/-  \n\n**Salary Details:**  \n- **Professor:** Basic Pay of Rs. 1,23,100  \n- **Associate Professor:** Basic Pay of Rs. 78,800  \n- **Assistant Professor:** Basic Pay of Rs. 67,700  \n- **Senior Residents:** Basic Pay of Rs. 67,700  \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Interview Date:** 29-10-2025 to 31-10-2025  \n\nThe selection process includes evaluation based on academic credentials and performance in the interview. Results will be announced on the official website.  \n\nDon\'t miss this excellent opportunity to join a prestigious institution. For more information and updates, please visit [www.esic.gov.in](http://www.esic.gov.in).\n',67,'2025-10-13','2025-10-21','2025-10-13 10:39:14','https://esic.gov.in/','https://esic.gov.in/attachments/recruitmentfile/Advertisement_No_06_of_2025_dated_11_10_2025_Recruitment_of_Teaching_Faculty_Senior_Residents_on_Contract_Basis_at_ESIC_Medical_College_and_Hospital_Indore_1760170635.pdf',0),
(135,'Employees\' State Insurance Corporation (ESIC) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 67 Positions of Teaching Faculty and Senior Residents','Employees\' State Insurance Corporation (ESIC)','MP','Full-time','','ESIC Medical College and Hospital (ESIC) has announced the Recruitment Notification for 2025, offering 67 vacancies for Teaching Faculty and Senior Residents. \n\n**Details of the Recruitment are as follows:**  \n- **Post Name:** Teaching Faculty/ Senior Residents  \n- **No of Posts:** 67  \n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs. 67,700-1,23,100  \n- **Qualification:** MBBS, M.Phil/Ph.D, MS/MD  \n- **Age Limit:** 45 and 69 years  \n- **Application Start Date:** 11-10-2025  \n- **Application End Date:** 21-10-2025  \n- **Official Website:** [esic.gov.in](http://esic.gov.in)  \n\n**Vacancy Details:**  \n- **Professor:** 10  \n- **Associate Professor:** 20  \n- **Assistant Professor:** 15  \n- **Senior Residents:** 22  \n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \n- Candidates should possess MBBS, M.Phil/Ph.D, MS/MD in relevant fields.  \n- Age limits as on 21-10-2025: Senior Residents - 45 years; Teaching Faculty - 69 years. Age relaxation as per rules is applicable.  \n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- SC/ST/ESIC Regular Employee, Defence Ex-servicemen/ PH Candidates: NIL  \n- All Other Categories: Rs. 500/-  \n\n**Salary Details:**  \n- **Professor:** Basic Pay of Rs. 1,23,100  \n- **Associate Professor:** Basic Pay of Rs. 78,800  \n- **Assistant Professor:** Basic Pay of Rs. 67,700  \n- **Senior Residents:** Basic Pay of Rs. 67,700  \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Interview Date:** 29-10-2025 to 31-10-2025  \n\nThe selection process includes evaluation based on academic credentials and performance in the interview. Results will be announced on the official website.  \n\nDon\'t miss this excellent opportunity to join a prestigious institution. For more information and updates, please visit [www.esic.gov.in](http://www.esic.gov.in).\n',67,'2025-10-13','2025-10-21','2025-10-13 1