(136,'Bank of Baroda Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 50 Positions Including Manager, Senior Manager, and More by October 30.','Bank of Baroda ','OD','Full-time','','Bank of Baroda has released an official notification for the recruitment of 50 positions, including Manager, Senior Manager, and more. Interested and eligible candidates are encouraged to apply online through the official Bank of Baroda website. Please note the important details below: \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Starting Date for Apply Online:** 10-10-2025 \n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 30-10-2025  \n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- For General, EWS and OBC candidates: Rs.850/- (Including GST) + Payment Gateway Charges  \n- For SC, ST, PWD, ESM/DESM & Women: Rs.175/- (Including GST) + Payment Gateway Charges  \n\n**Age Limit:**  \n- Manager Credit Analyst: Min. 25 Max. 30  \n- Senior Manager Credit Analyst: Min. 28 Max. 35  \n- Chief Manager Credit Analyst: Min. 32 Max. 42  \n- Senior Manager C & IC Relationship Manager: Min. 28 Max. 35  \n- Chief Manager C&IC Relationship Manager: Min. 32 Max. 42  \n\n**Qualification Requirements:**  \nAll positions require a Graduation degree in any discipline and a Post Graduate Degree/Diploma with a specialization in Finance or equivalent (or CA/CMA/CS/CFA).\n\n**Salary Range:**  \n- MMG/S – II: 64820 - 67160 - 93960  \n- MMG/S-III: 85920 - 99320 - 105280  \n- SMG/S-IV: 102300 - 114220 - 120940  \n\n**Vacancies Available:**  \n- Manager- Credit Analyst: 01  \n- Senior Manager- Credit Analyst: 25  \n- Chief Manager- Credit Analyst: 02  \n- Senior Manager C & IC Relationship Manager: 16  \n- Chief Manager C&IC Relationship Manager: 06  \n\nTo apply, please visit the Bank of Baroda official website at bankofbaroda.bank.in.\n\nWe wish all candidates the best of luck!',50,'2025-10-13','2025-10-30','2025-10-13 10:47:07','https://bankapps.bankofbaroda.co.in/BOBRECRUITMENT_OCT_CIC2507621/','https://bankofbaroda.bank.in/-/media/Project/BOB/CountryWebsites/India/Career/2025/25-10/Advertisement-10-10-2025.pdf',0),
(137,'Punjab Public Service Commission (PPSC) Group (A) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 21 District Defense Services Welfare Officer Positions','Punjab Public Service Commission (PPSC) ','PB','Full-time','','Punjab Public Service Commission(PPSC) Recruitment 2025 for 21 posts of District Defense Services Welfare Officer - Group (A). This is an excellent opportunity for those holding any Bachelor\'s degree.\n\nKey Details:\n- **Company Name:** Punjab Public Service Commission (PPSC)\n- **No of Posts:** 21\n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs 47,600\n- **Qualification:** Any Bachelor\'s Degree\n- **Age Limit:** Not more than 55 years\n- **Application Start Date:** 08-10-2025\n- **Application Closing Date:** 03-11-2025\n- **Official Website:** [ppsc.gov.in](http://ppsc.gov.in)\n\n### Vacancy Details:\n- **Ex-Servicemen, Punjab:** 7 (2 reserved for Women)\n- **Sports Person, Punjab:** 1\n- **Persons with Disabilities:** 1\n- **Scheduled Castes (Others) ESM, Punjab:** 3 (1 reserved for Women)\n- **Balmiki/Mazhbi Sikh ESM, Punjab:** 4 (1 reserved for Women)\n- **Backward Classes ESM, Punjab:** 2\n- **General EWS, Punjab:** 3 (1 reserved for Women)\n\n### Eligibility Criteria:\n- Bachelor\'s Degree from a recognized University.\n- Ex-Indian Commissioned Officers of the rank of Colonel or Lieutenant Colonel or equivalent ranks.\n- Must have passed Matriculation with Punjabi as a compulsory subject.\n\n### Application Fees:\n- **Ex-Serviceman, EWS, PWD:** Rs. 500/-\n- **SC/ST/Backward Classes:** Rs. 750/-\n- **All Other Categories:** Rs. 1500/-\n\n### Important Dates:\n- **Application Fee Payment:** 08/10/2025 – 03/11/2025 (by 11:59 PM)\n\nDon\'t miss this chance to be part of an esteemed organization. Apply online through the PPSC website available from October 8, 2025.',21,'2025-10-13','2025-11-03','2025-10-13 10:54:25','https://ppsc.gov.in/errorpageinfo.aspx?error=Info%2011-%20Session%20has%20Expired%20due%20to%20use%20of%20Back%20Button%20or%20Browser%20Refresh%20or%20Click%20on%20the%20link%20again%20before%20your%20earlier%20request%20is%20processed.Kindly%20Close%20B','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/10/963217-68e732019adb247637179.pdf',0),
