(140,'Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB) Ayush Officer Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 1535 Positions by November 08','Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)','RJ','Full-time','','Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB) has released an official notification for the recruitment of 1,535 Contractual Ayush Officer posts. Interested and eligible candidates can apply online through the official RSSB website. \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Starting Date for Apply Online:** 10-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 08-11-2025  \n- **Exam Date:** 26-12-2025  \n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \nCandidates with the following qualifications can apply:  \n- BAMS (Bachelor of Ayurvedic Medicine and Surgery)  \n- BHMS (Bachelor of Homoeopathic Medicine and Surgery)  \n- BUMS (Bachelor of Unani Medicine and Surgery)  \n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- General / Creamy Layer OBC/MBC Candidates: Rs. 600  \n- Non-Creamy Layer OBC/MBC, EWS, SC, ST (Rajasthan Candidates): Rs. 400/-  \n- All PwD Candidates: Rs. 400/-  \n\n**Age Limit (as of 01-01-2026):**  \n- Minimum Age: 21 Years  \n- Maximum Age: 40 Years  \nAge relaxation is applicable as per the rules.\n\n**Salary:**  \nThe selected candidates for the position of Contractual Ayush Officer will receive a salary of Rs. 28,050/-.  \n\n**Vacancy Details:**  \n- Contractual Ayush Officer (Ayurved/ Homoeopathy/ Unani) - Non-Scheduled Area: 1,340  \n- Contractual Ayush Officer (Ayurved/ Homoeopathy/ Unani) - Scheduled Area: 195  \n\nFor more details, please visit the official RSSB website at [rssb.rajasthan.gov.in](http://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in).\n\nBest of luck to all applicants!',1535,'2025-10-13','2025-11-08','2025-10-13 11:24:14','https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/','https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/storage/advertisement_item/1760090521.pdf',0),
(141,'Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB) Ayush Officer Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 1535 Positions by November 08','Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB)','RJ','Full-time','','Rajasthan Staff Selection Board (RSSB) has released an official notification for the recruitment of 1,535 Contractual Ayush Officer posts. Interested and eligible candidates can apply online through the official RSSB website. \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Starting Date for Apply Online:** 10-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 08-11-2025  \n- **Exam Date:** 26-12-2025  \n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \nCandidates with the following qualifications can apply:  \n- BAMS (Bachelor of Ayurvedic Medicine and Surgery)  \n- BHMS (Bachelor of Homoeopathic Medicine and Surgery)  \n- BUMS (Bachelor of Unani Medicine and Surgery)  \n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- General / Creamy Layer OBC/MBC Candidates: Rs. 600  \n- Non-Creamy Layer OBC/MBC, EWS, SC, ST (Rajasthan Candidates): Rs. 400/-  \n- All PwD Candidates: Rs. 400/-  \n\n**Age Limit (as of 01-01-2026):**  \n- Minimum Age: 21 Years  \n- Maximum Age: 40 Years  \nAge relaxation is applicable as per the rules.\n\n**Salary:**  \nThe selected candidates for the position of Contractual Ayush Officer will receive a salary of Rs. 28,050/-.  \n\n**Vacancy Details:**  \n- Contractual Ayush Officer (Ayurved/ Homoeopathy/ Unani) - Non-Scheduled Area: 1,340  \n- Contractual Ayush Officer (Ayurved/ Homoeopathy/ Unani) - Scheduled Area: 195  \n\nFor more details, please visit the official RSSB website at [rssb.rajasthan.gov.in](http://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in).\n\nBest of luck to all applicants!',1535,'2025-10-13','2025-11-08','2025-10-13 11:24:14','https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/','https://rssb.rajasthan.gov.in/storage/advertisement_item/1760090521.pdf',0),
(142,'Tenkasi Revenue Department(TN) is recruiting 38 Village Assistants for the year 2025 - Submit your application offline for 38 available positions.','Tenkasi Revenue Department(TN)','TN','Full-time','','Tenkasi Revenue Department - \n\nThis is a great opportunity for eligible candidates to join our esteemed department. Here are the key details:\n\n**Position:** - Village Assistant  \n**Total Posts:** - 38  \n**Pay Matrix:** Rs.11100 - 35100  \n**Qualification:** 10TH  \n**Age Limit:** 21 to 32 years  \n\n**Vacancy Distribution:**  \n- Village Assistant - Tenkasi: 04  \n- Village Assistant - Alangulam: 10  \n- Village Assistant - Kadayanallur: 08  \n- Village Assistant - Shenkottai: 06  \n- Village Assistant - Sivagiri: 06  \n- Village Assistant - Thiruvenkadam: 02  \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Starting Date for Applications:** 10-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Applications:** 24-10-2025  \n\n**How to Apply:**  \nInterested candidates must fill out the application form adequately and submit it to the Tenkasi Revenue Taluk Office. All applications must be received by 05:45 PM on October 24, 2025. Please remember that late applications will not be accepted, and only one application per candidate is allowed for one village.\n\nDon’t miss this chance to be a part of the Tenkasi Revenue Department. For more details, please visit our official website at [tenkasi.nic.in](http://tenkasi.nic.in).',38,'2025-10-13','2025-10-24','2025-10-13 11:27:54','https://tenkasi.nic.in/','https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s37cbbc409ec990f19c78c75bd1e06f215/uploads/2025/10/17600921282629.pdf',0),
(143,'Tenkasi Revenue Department (TN) is recruiting Village Assistants for the year 2025 - Submit your application offline for 38 available positions.','Tenkasi Revenue Department (TN)','TN','Full-time','','Tenkasi Revenue Department. This is a great opportunity for eligible candidates to join our esteemed department. Here are the key details:\n\n**Position:** Village Assistant  \n**Total Posts:** 38  \n**Pay Matrix:** Rs.11100 - 35100  \n**Qualification:** 10TH  \n**Age Limit:** 21 to 32 years  \n\n**Vacancy Distribution:**  \n- Village Assistant - Tenkasi: 04  \n- Village Assistant - Alangulam: 10  \n- Village Assistant - Kadayanallur: 08  \n- Village Assistant - Shenkottai: 06  \n- Village Assistant - Sivagiri: 06  \n- Village Assistant - Thiruvenkadam: 02  \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Starting Date for Applications:** 10-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Applications:** 24-10-2025  \n\n**How to Apply:**  \nInterested candidates must fill out the application form adequately and submit it to the Tenkasi Revenue Taluk Office. All applications must be received by 05:45 PM on October 24, 2025. Please remember that late applications will not be accepted, and only one application per candidate is allowed for one village.\n\nDon’t miss this chance to be a part of the Tenkasi Revenue Department. For more details, please visit our official website at [tenkasi.nic.in](http://tenkasi.nic.in).',38,'2025-10-13','2025-10-24','2025-10-13 11:27:54','https://tenkasi.nic.in/','https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s37cbbc409ec990f19c78c75bd1e06f215/uploads/2025/10/17600921282629.pdf',0),
(144,'Rural Development and Panchayat Raj Department TN (TNRD) Panchayat Secretary Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 1483 Positions','Rural Development and Panchayat Raj Department TN (TNRD)','TN','Full-time','','TNRD Panchayat Secretary Recruitment 2025. The Rural Development and Panchayat Raj Department of Tamil Nadu (TNRD) has officially released a notification for the recruitment of 1,483 Panchayat Secretary vacancies. Eligible candidates who have completed their 10th standard can apply online from 10th October 2025 to 9th November 2025 at the official TNRD website: tnrd.tn.gov.in.\n\nHere are the key details regarding the recruitment:\n\n- **Position:** Panchayat Secretary  \n- **Number of Posts:** 1483  \n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs. 15,900  \n- **Qualification:** 10th standard, with Tamil studied up to 8th standard  \n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 32 years (with relaxation for certain categories)  \n- **Application Fee:** Rs. 100 for General Category; Rs. 50 for SC/ST/PwD  \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Start Date for Online Application:** 10-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Online Application:** 09-11-2025  \n',1483,'2025-10-13','2025-11-09','2025-10-13 11:29:57','https://tnrd.tn.gov.in/project/recruitment/Application_form_ps_Display.php','https://tnrd.tn.gov.in/project/Recruitment_Report/ps_communal_category_wise_vacancy_details_roaster.php',0),
(145,'Kancheepuram Revenue Department (TN) is recruiting Village Assistants for the year 2025 - Submit your application offline for 109 positions.','Kancheepuram Revenue Department (TN)','TN','Full-time','','Kancheepuram Revenue Department for the position of Village Assistant. Here are the key details:\n\n- **Company Name**: Kancheepuram Revenue Department  \n- **Post Name**: Village Assistant  \n- **Number of Posts**: 109  \n- **Pay Matrix**: ₹11,100 - ₹35,100  \n- **Qualification**: 10TH  \n- **Age Limit**: 21 to 32 years  \n- **Application Dates**: 11th October 2025 to 25th October 2025  \n- **Official Website**: [kancheepuram.nic.in](https://kancheepuram.nic.in)  \n\n### **Vacancy Details by Taluk**  \n- Kancheepuram Taluk: 34  \n- Sriperumbudur Taluk: 08  \n- Uthiramerur Taluk: 31  \n- Walajabad Taluk: 19  \n- Kundrathur Taluk: 17  \n\n### **Eligibility Criteria**  \n- The applicant must have completed the 10th-grade/SSLC final examination with Tamil as a subject.\n- The SSLC mark sheet must be submitted compulsorily.\n- Candidates may apply even if they have not passed the 10th-grade examination.\n\n### **Application Process**  \n- The application form and additional details about the selection process can be found on the Kanchipuram District Collector\'s office website: [Recruitment](https://Kancheepuram.nic.in/notice category/recruitment/).\n- Completed application forms must be sent by registered post to the Tahsildar\'s Office at the following address before 5:45 PM on 25th October 2025:\n\n**Address:**  \nTahsildar,  \nTahsildar\'s Office,  \nKundrathur Taluk,  \nKanchipuram District.\n\nPlease forward this information to anyone who might be interested.\n',109,'2025-10-13','2025-10-25','2025-10-13 11:32:55','https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s31543843a4723ed2ab08e18053ae6dc5b/uploads/2025/10/17600941377668.pdf','https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s31543843a4723ed2ab08e18053ae6dc5b/uploads/2025/10/17600944405246.pdf',0),
(146,' Bank of Baroda Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 50 Positions Including Manager, Senior Manager, and More by October 30.',' Bank of Baroda','UK','Full-time','','\nBank of Baroda has released an official notification for the recruitment of 50 positions, including Manager, Senior Manager, and more. Interested and eligible candidates are encouraged to apply online through the official Bank of Baroda website. Please note the important details below:\n\n**Important Dates:**\n- **Starting Date for Apply Online:** 10-10-2025\n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 30-10-2025\n\n**Application Fee:**\n- For General, EWS and OBC candidates: Rs.850/- (Including GST) + Payment Gateway Charges\n- For SC, ST, PWD, ESM/DESM & Women: Rs.175/- (Including GST) + Payment Gateway Charges\n\n**Age Limit:**\n- Manager Credit Analyst: Min. 25 Max. 30\n- Senior Manager Credit Analyst: Min. 28 Max. 35\n- Chief Manager Credit Analyst: Min. 32 Max. 42\n- Senior Manager C & IC Relationship Manager: Min. 28 Max. 35\n- Chief Manager C&IC Relationship Manager: Min. 32 Max. 42\n\n**Qualification Requirements:**\nAll positions require a Graduation degree in any discipline and a Post Graduate Degree/Diploma with a specialization in Finance or equivalent (or CA/CMA/CS/CFA).\n\n**Salary Range:**\n- MMG/S – II: 64820 - 67160 - 93960\n- MMG/S-III: 85920 - 99320 - 105280\n- SMG/S-IV: 102300 - 114220 - 120940\n\n**Vacancies Available:**\n- Manager- Credit Analyst: 01\n- Senior Manager- Credit Analyst: 25\n- Chief Manager- Credit Analyst: 02\n- Senior Manager C & IC Relationship Manager: 16\n- Chief Manager C&IC Relationship Manager: 06\n\nTo apply, please visit the Bank of Baroda official website at bankofbaroda.bank.in.\n\nWe wish all candidates the best of luck!',50,'2025-10-13','2025-10-30','2025-10-13 11:47:57','https://bankapps.bankofbaroda.co.in/BOBRECRUITMENT_OCT_CIC2507621/','https://bankofbaroda.bank.in/-/media/Project/BOB/CountryWebsites/India/Career/2025/25-10/Advertisement-10-10-2025.pdf',0),
