(153,'National Bank for Agriculture and Rural Development (NABARD) Specialists Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 06 Positions','National Bank for Agriculture and Rural Development (NABARD)','AP','Full-time','','National Bank for Agriculture and Rural Development (NABARD) for the year 2025. They are looking to fill 06 specialist posts with various qualifications. Here are the details:\n\n**Company Name:** National Bank for Agriculture and Rural Development (NABARD)  \n**Post Name:** Specialists  \n**No of Posts:** 06  \n**Pay Matrix:** Rs. 125000-200000  \n**Qualification:** Any Graduate, BCA, B.Sc, B.Tech/B.E, Any Master’s Degree, CA, M.Sc, M.E/M.Tech, MBA/PGDM, MCA  \n**Age Limit:** 25 to 55 years  \n**Application Dates:**  \n- Start Date: 13-10-2025  \n- End Date: 28-10-2025  \n**Official Website:** nabard.org  \n\n### Vacancy Details  \n1. Climate Change Specialist - Mitigation  \n2. IT Specialist (Carbon Finance Cell)  \n3. Head – Rural Tech and Innovations  \n4. Head - Data & Impact Evaluation  \n5. Head – Finance, Compliance and Commercialization  \n6. E-Commerce Specialist  \n\n### Eligibility Criteria (Selected Positions)  \n- **Climate Change Specialist - Mitigation:** Master’s in Renewable Energy or related fields.  \n- **IT Specialist:** Bachelor’s or Master’s in IT or Computer Science.  \n- **Head – Rural Tech and Innovations:** Master’s related to Agri-Business or Engineering.  \n- **E-Commerce Specialist:** Graduate/Postgraduate in marketing with e-marketing experience preferred.  \n\n### Salary and Application Fee  \n- Salary ranges based on position (from Rs. 1.25 lakh to Rs. 30 lakh per annum)\n- Application fees vary: SC/ST/PWBD candidates pay Rs. 150, others Rs. 850.\n\nPlease review the positions and consider applying if you\'re interested. The online application process opens in a few days. ',6,'2025-10-13','2025-10-28','2025-10-13 12:00:31','https://ibpsreg.ibps.in/nabardsep25/','https://www.nabard.org/auth/writereaddata/CareerNotices/1310253019Final-Advtertisement-RMSMED-DCAS-DMFI-N.pdf',0),
(154,'Rail Vikas Nigam (RVNL) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 09 Manager and Deputy Manager Positions','Rail Vikas Nigam (RVNL)','AP','Full-time','','Rail Vikas Nigam (RVNL) for various managerial positions. Here are the key details:\n\n**Company Name:** Rail Vikas Nigam (RVNL)  \n**Post Names:** Manager (S&T), Deputy Manager (S&T)  \n**No of Posts:** 09  \n**Pay Matrix:** Rs. 40000-160000  \n**Qualification:** B.Tech/B.E, Diploma  \n**Application Method:** Offline  \n**Application Start Date:** 13-10-2025  \n**Application End Date:** 12-11-2025  \n**Official Website:** [rvnl.org](http://rvnl.org)  \n\n**Vacancy Details:**  \n- Manager(S&T)(E-2): 04  \n- Dy. Manager(S&T)(E-1): 05  \n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \n- **Manager(S&T)(E-2):** Graduate degree in Electrical Engineering/Electronics and Communication Engineering with a minimum of 50% marks from a recognized institute, or a Diploma in the relevant engineering fields with knowledge of computer operations.  \n- **Dy. Manager(S&T)(E-1):** Similar qualifications as above with an age limit of 35 years for Dy. Manager and 40 years for Manager.\n\n**Salary:**  \n- Manager(S&T)(E-2): Rs. 50000-160000/- + Applicable Allowances  \n- Dy. Manager(S&T)(E-1): Rs. 40000-140000/- + Applicable Allowances  \n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- UR/OBC Category: Rs. 400/-  \n- SC/ST/EWS Category: NIL  \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- Start Date for Applying: 13-10-2025  \n- Last Date for Applying: 12-11-2025  \n\nInterested candidates are encouraged to apply on or before the deadline. For further details, please visit the official website.\n',9,'2025-10-13','2025-11-12','2025-10-13 12:05:26','https://rvnl.org/','https://rvnl.org/RVNL_cms/uploads/careers/ADVT_NO_27_2025_dated_13_October_2025.pdf',0),
(155,'North Eastern Railway (RRC NER) Sports Quota Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 49 Group C and Group D Positions','North Eastern Railway (RRC NER)','AP','Full-time','','RRC North Eastern Railway concerning their Sports Quota Recruitment for the year 2025. \n\n**Highlights of the Recruitment:**  \n- **Company Name:** North Eastern Railway (RRC NER) \n- **Post Name:** Group C and Group D \n- **Total Vacancies:** 49 (21 for Group ‘C’ and 28 for Erstwhile Group ‘D’)  \n- **Eligibility:** Any Graduate, ITI, 12TH, 10TH  \n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 25 years (born between 02/01/2001 and 01/01/2008)  \n- **Application Period:** 11-10-2025 to 10-11-2025  \n- **Official Website:** [ner.indianrailways.gov.in](https://ner.indianrailways.gov.in)\n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- SC, ST, Ex-Servicemen, Persons with Benchmark Disabilities, Women, Minorities, and Economically Backward Classes: Rs. 250 (Refundable)\n- All other candidates: Rs. 500 (Refundable)\n\n**Selection Process:**  \nThe selection will be based on the candidates\' performance in sports trials and evaluation of educational achievements.  \n\nThis is a great opportunity for eligible candidates looking to join the Railways through sports quota.  \n\nIf you know anyone who might be interested, please forward this information to them.',49,'2025-10-14','2025-11-10','2025-10-14 11:32:24','https://sports.rrcner.net/','https://ner.indianrailways.gov.in/uploads/files/1760096880414-SQ%20Notification%20Eng%202025-26%20Final.pdf',0),
(156,'Women and Child Development NTR District (WCD NTR District) District Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 20 Positions Including Accountant, Doctor, and More','Women and Child Development NTR District (WCD NTR District)','AP','Full-time','',' Women and Child Development NTR District (WCD NTR District) regarding the recruitment of various posts. Here are the details:\n\n**Company Name:** Women and Child Development NTR District (WCD NTR District)  \n**Post Name:** Accountant, Doctor and More  \n**No of Posts:** 20  \n**Pay Matrix:** Rs. 7,944 - 18,536  \n**Qualification:** Bachelors Degree, B.Com, B.Ed, MBBS, 12TH, 10TH  \n**Age Limit:** 18 to 42 years  \n**Start Date for Apply:** 13-10-2025  \n**Last Date for Apply:** 22-10-2025  \n**Official Website:** [ntr.ap.gov.in](http://ntr.ap.gov.in)\n\n### Vacancy Details:\n- Accountant: 01\n- Assistant Cum Data Entry Operator: 01\n- Doctor (part time): 01\n- Ayah: 06\n- Chowkidar(Watch man): 01\n- Educator(Part-time): 01\n- Art & Craft-cum Music Teacher(Part-time): 02\n- P.T. lnstructor-Cum Yoga Teacher(Part-Time): 02\n- Cook (Out sourcing basis): 01\n- Helper Out sourcing basis: 01\n- House Keeper Out sourcing basis: 02\n- Hetpur Cum Night Watchmen(Women) Out sourcing basis: 01\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\nCandidates must meet the qualifications as specified for each role. Please refer to the official notification for specific criteria concerning education, experience, and local engagement requirements.\n\n**Important Dates:**\n- **Starting Date for Apply:** 13-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Apply:** 22-10-2025\n\nI encourage all interested and eligible candidates to visit the official website to apply and find more details about the roles.',20,'2025-10-14','2025-10-22','2025-10-14 11:36:08','https://ntr.ap.gov.in/','https://cdn.s3waas.gov.in/s39461cce28ebe3e76fb4b931c35a169b0/uploads/2025/10/17603505889390.pdf',0),
(157,'Satish Dhawan Space Centre (ISRO SDSC SHAR) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 141 Positions Including Technician, Draughtsman, and More','Satish Dhawan Space Centre (ISRO SDSC SHAR)','AP','Full-time','','Satish Dhawan Space Centre (ISRO SDSC SHAR). They are inviting applications for a total of 141 positions, including Technician, Draughtsman, and several other roles. \n\n**Details of the Recruitment:**  \n- **Company Name:** Satish Dhawan Space Centre (ISRO SDSC SHAR)  \n- **Post Name:** Technician, Draughtsman and More  \n- **Total Vacancies:** 141  \n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs. 19,900 - Rs. 1,77,500  \n- **Qualification:** Various eligibility criteria including Any Graduate/PG, Diploma, ITI, etc.  \n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 35 years (varies by position)  \n- **Application Period:** 16 October to 14 November 2025  \n- **Official Website:** [isro.gov.in](http://isro.gov.in)\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \nEligibility differs by position, so I recommend checking the official website for specific qualifications required for each role. \n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- For various candidates: Rs. 750 or Rs. 500 (reduced fee for certain groups)  \n- For women, SC/ST/PWBD, Ex-Servicemen: NIL  \n\nMake sure to apply online before the closing date if interested, and feel free to reach out if you have any questions about the application process.',141,'2025-10-16','2025-11-14','2025-10-16 10:35:04','https://apps.shar.gov.in/Recruitment01_2025/main.jsp','https://apps.shar.gov.in/sdscshar/advt_2025/Bilingual%20Advertisement%20for%20all%20posts%2016.10.2025.pdf',0),
(158,'Power Grid Corporation of India (POWERGRID) Officer Trainee Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 20 Positions','Power Grid Corporation of India (POWERGRID)','AP','Full-time','','Power Grid Corporation of India (POWERGRID) is recruiting for 20 posts of Officer Trainee. This opportunity is open to candidates who possess CA, ICWA, or ICSI qualifications. \n\n**Details of the Recruitment:**\n- **Company Name:** Power Grid Corporation of India (POWERGRID)  \n- **Post Name:** Officer Trainee  \n- **Number of Posts:** 20  \n- **Pay Matrix:** ₹ 50,000/- 3%- 1,60,000/- (IDA)  \n- **Eligibility Criteria:** CA, ICWA, ICSI  \n- **Age Limit:** Maximum age of 28 years (age relaxation applicable as per rules)  \n- **Application Fee:** Non-refundable ₹ 500/-, exempt for SC/ST/PwBD candidates  \n\n**Vacancy Details:**\n- **Officer Trainee (Finance):** 17 + 2  \n- **Officer Trainee (Co Secy):** 1  \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Start Date for Online Application:** 15-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Online Application:** 05-11-2025  \n\nCandidates can apply online through the POWERGRID website: [powergrid.in](http://powergrid.in)\n\nWe encourage all eligible candidates to take advantage of this opportunity.  \n',20,'2025-10-16','2025-11-05','2025-10-16 10:37:37','https://www.powergrid.in/en/job-opportunities','https://www.powergrid.in/sites/default/files/job_opportunities_document/Adv_CC_05_2025_Final.pdf',0),
(159,'Rail India Technical and Economic Service (RITES) is seeking applications for the position of Senior Technical Assistant for the year 2025 - Submit your application online for 600 available positions.','Rail India Technical and Economic Service (RITES)','AP','Full-time','','Rail India Technical and Economic Service (RITES). They are inviting applications for 600 positions of Senior Technical Assistant. \n\nHere are the key details:  \n- **Company Name:** Rail India Technical and Economic Service (RITES)  \n- **Post Name:** Senior Technical Assistant  \n- **No of Posts:** 600  \n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs. 29,735  \n- **Qualification:** Full-time Diploma in relevant engineering fields or B.Sc. in Chemistry  \n- **Age Limit:** Maximum 40 years (age relaxation as per rules)  \n- **Application Fee:**  \n   - General/OBC Candidates: Rs. 300/- plus Taxes  \n   - EWS/SC/ST/PWD Candidates: Rs. 100/- plus Taxes  \n- **Online Application Period:** 14th October 2025 to 12th November 2025  \n- **Date of Written Test:** 23rd November 2025  \n- **Official Website:** [rites.com](https://www.rites.com)\n\nI encourage you to visit the official website for more details and to apply if you\'re interested. It\'s a great opportunity to advance your career in a reputable organization.',600,'2025-10-16','2025-11-12','2025-10-16 10:39:40','https://rites.com/','https://www.rites.com/Upload/Career/M_61_88_25_advertisement_(1)_pdf-2025-Oct-14-17-15-23.pdf',0),
(160,'South Eastern Coalfields (SECL)  Assistant Foreman Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 543 Positions','South Eastern Coalfields (SECL) ','AP','Full-time','','South Eastern Coalfields (SECL) for the position of Assistant Foreman. There are a total of 543 vacancies available, and eligible candidates can apply online starting from 16th October 2025 until 9th November 2025 via their official website at secl-cil.in.\n\n**Position Details:**  \n- **Post Name:** Assistant Foreman (Electrical) T&S, Grade -C (Trainee)  \n- **No of Vacancies:** 543  \n- **Qualifications Required:**  \n  - B.Tech/B.E in Electrical & Electronics Engineering \n  - Diploma in Electrical Engineering (Minimum 3 years\' course approved by AICTE)  \n  - Departmental candidates must have 3 years\' experience.  \n  - Supervisory certificate valid for working as Electrical Supervisor in Mines.\n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Start Date for Apply Online:** 16-10-2025  \n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 09-11-2025\n\nFor more detailed information regarding eligibility criteria, age limit, and application fees, please refer to the official notification.\n\nFeel free to share this with anyone who might be eligible and interested in applying. Let me know if you have any questions or need further assistance!\n',543,'2025-10-16','2025-11-09','2025-10-16 10:42:31','https://secl-cil.in/index.php','https://secl-cil.in/writereaddata/Notification%20for%20Asst%20Forman%20%28electrical%202025%29.pdf',0),
(161,'Telangana State Cooperative Apex Bank (TSCAB) Staff Assistant Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 225 Positions','Telangana State Cooperative Apex Bank (TSCAB)','TN','Full-time','','Telangana State Cooperative Apex Bank (TSCAB). They have released an official notification for the hiring of 225 Staff Assistant posts. Here are the key details:\n\n- **Post Name:** Staff Assistant  \n- **No of Posts:** 225  \n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs. 24050-64480  \n- **Qualification:** Any Graduate  \n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 30 years  \n- **Online Application Start Date:** 18-10-2025  \n- **Last Date to Apply:** 06-11-2025  \n- **Official Website:** [tgcab.bank.in](http://tgcab.bank.in)  \n\n### TSCAB Staff Assistant Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details \n- **Hyderabad DCCB:** 32  \n- **Karimnagar DCCB:** 43  \n- **Khammam DCCB:** 99  \n- **Mahabubnagar DCCB:** 09  \n- **Medak DCCB:** 21  \n- **Warangal DCCB:** 21  \n\n### Eligibility Criteria \n- Any Graduate from a Recognized University.\n- Proficiency in Telugu Language (The candidate should have studied Telugu as one of the subjects in any class up to 10th Class).\n- Knowledge of English is required.\n\n### Age Limit (as of 01-10-2025) \n- Minimum Age Limit: 18 Years  \n- Maximum Age Limit: 30 Years  \n\n### Salary \n- The Scale of Pay is as follows:\n   - Rs.24050-1340/3-28070-1650/3-33020-2000/4-41020-2340/7-57400-4400/1-61800-2680/1-64480 \n\n### Application Fees \n- For SC/ST/PC/EXSM category: Rs. 500/-  \n- For General/BC/EWS category: Rs. 1000/-  \n\n### Important Dates \n- **Application Start Date:** 18-10-2025  \n- **Application End Date:** 06-11-2025  \n- **Date of Online Examination:** December 2025  \n\nIf you know any eligible candidates who might be interested, please share this information with them. For further details, candidates can visit the official TSCAB website at [tgcab.bank.in](http://tgcab.bank.in).',225,'2025-10-24','2025-11-06','2025-10-24 07:09:06','https://ibpsreg.ibps.in/dccbsep25/','https://tgcab.bank.in/notifications',0),
(162,'Territorial Indian Army Rally Recruitment - 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 1426 Soldier Positions','Territorial Indian Army Rally','PB','Full-time','','Territorial Army for 2025. They are looking to fill 1426 Soldier vacancies, with eligibility for those who have completed their 10th or 12th grade. The application process opens on November 15, 2025, and will close on December 1, 2025. \n\n**Details of the Recruitment:**  \n- **Number of Posts:** 1426  \n- **Post Names:** Various including Soldier (General Duty), Clerk, Chef, and more.  \n- **Qualification:** 10th/12th pass  \n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 42 years  \n- **Application Link:** [ncs.gov.in](https://www.ncs.gov.in)\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \n- Soldier (General Duty): 10th pass with 45% marks in aggregate.  \n- Soldier (Clerk): 12th pass with 60% marks in any stream.  \n- Tradesmen positions: 10th pass (varied requirements based on the role).\n\nFor more information and to apply, please visit the official website. Ensure to check the eligibility criteria and gather all necessary documents before submitting your application.\n',1426,'2025-10-24','2025-12-01','2025-10-24 07:12:49','https://www.ncs.gov.in/','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/10/741560-68f3142c5320320308589.pdf',0),
(163,'State Bank of India (SBI) SCO Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 103 Positions','State Bank of India (SBI)','AP','Full-time','','State Bank of India (SBI) has released 103 vacancies for Specialist Cadre Officers. We invite eligible candidates to apply online for positions ranging from Head of Product, Investment & Research to Investment Officers. \n\n**Recruitment Details:**\n- **Post Name:** Specialist Cadre Officers\n- **Number of Posts:** 103  \n- **Qualifications:** Any Graduate, B.A, B.Com, Any Post Graduate, CA, MBA/PGDM, PG Diploma  \n- **Age Limit:** 25 to 50 years  \n- **Application Dates:** 27th October 2025 - 17th November 2025\n- **Official Website:** [sbi.bank.in](http://sbi.bank.in)\n\n**Key Vacancies:** \n- Head (Product, Investment & Research): 1 \n- Zonal Head (Retail): 4 \n- Regional Head: 7 \n- Relationship Manager-Team Lead: 19  \n- Investment Specialist (IS): 22  \n- Investment Officer (IO): 46  \n- Project Development Manager (Business): 2  \n- Central Research Team (Support): 2  \n\n**Salary Range:** \n- CTC Upper Range up to Rs. 135.00 Lakhs for Head (Product, Investment & Research)  \n- Varies for other positions as listed above.\n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- For UR/EWS/OBC candidates: Rs. 750/-  \n- For SC/ST/PwBD candidates: Nil  \n\n**Payment Method:**  \nApplication fees can be paid online using Debit Card, Credit Card, or Internet Banking. \n\n**Important Note:**\nPlease ensure the completion of your application before the closing date. We look forward to your applications and wish you the best of luck in your pursuit of a career at SBI!',103,'2025-10-28','2025-11-17','2025-10-28 09:45:23','https://recruitment.sbi.bank.in/crpd-sco-2025-26-15/apply','https://sbi.bank.in/documents/77530/52947104/Advertisement+_Wealth+MGMT_27.10.2025.pdf/717eb027-4b72-c427-9a5a-e254a35108af?t=1761543501962',0),
(164,'Railway Recruitment Board (RRB NTPC) Undergraduate Level Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 3058 Positions','Railway Recruitment Board (RRB NTPC)','GJ','Full-time','','Railway Recruitment Board (RRB NTPC) about vacancies for Trains Clerk, Junior Clerk Cum Typist, and more. \n\nThey have released a total of 3058 positions, and eligible candidates who have completed their 12th can apply online starting from October 28, 2025, until November 27, 2025.\n\nrailway ntpc recruitment 2025\n\n**Details of the Recruitment:**\n- **Post Names:** Trains Clerk, Junior Clerk Cum Typist, Commercial Cum Ticket Clerk, and Accounts Clerk Cum Typist.\n- **Total Vacancies:** 3058 \n- **Eligibility:** 12TH (with specified aggregate scores and typing proficiency)\n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 30 years \n- **Salary Ranges:** \n  - Commercial Cum Ticket Clerk: ₹21,700\n  - Accounts Clerk cum Typist: ₹19,900\n  - Junior Clerk cum Typist: ₹19,900\n  - Trains Clerk: ₹19,900\n\n**Application Fees:** \n- General Candidates: ₹500\n- SC/ST/Ex-Servicemen/PwBD/Female/Transgender/Minorities/EBC: ₹250\n\n**Important Dates:**\n- **Start Date for Apply Online:** 28-10-2025\n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 27-11-2025\n- **Application Fee Payment Deadline:** 29-11-2025\n- **Modification Window:** 30-11-2025 to 09-12-2025\n- **Scribe Details Submission:** 10-12-2025 to 14-12-2025  \n\nFor more details, you can visit the official website: [rrbchennai.gov.in](http://rrbchennai.gov.in)',3058,'2025-10-28','2025-11-27','2025-10-28 09:59:27','https://www.rrbapply.gov.in/#/auth/landing','https://www.rrbchennai.gov.in/downloads/CEN-07-2025-NTPC-UnderGraduate-English.pdf',0),
(165,'Indian Railway Catering and Tourism Corporation (IRCTC) Hospitality Monitors Recruitment 2025 – Walk-in for 46 Positions','Indian Railway Catering and Tourism Corporation (IRCTC)','AP','Full-time','','Indian Railway Catering and Tourism Corporation (IRCTC) has announced a recruitment drive for 46 posts of Hospitality Monitors.\n\n**Important Details:**  \n- **Walk-in Interview Dates:** 13-11-2025 to 14-11-2025  \n- **Maximum Age Limit:** 28 Years  \n- **Salary:** Total CTC of Rs 30,000/- per month (including statutory deductions and allowances)\n\n**Qualifications Required:**  \n- Full time B.Sc. in Hospitality and Hotel Administration from a CIHM/SIHM/PIHM affiliated with NCHM&CT/UGC/AICTE/Government of India.  \n- BBA/MBA (Culinary Arts) from Indian Culinary Institutes under the Ministry of Tourism.  \n- B.Sc. in Hotel Management and Catering Science from recognized universities affiliated with UGC/AICTE/Government of India/State Government.  \n- M.B.A in Tourism and Hotel Management from recognized universities affiliated with UGC/AICTE/Government of India/State Government.\n\nInterested candidates are encouraged to attend the walk-in interviews. For more detailed information, please visit the official IRCTC website at www.irctc.com.\n',46,'2025-10-29','2025-11-14','2025-10-29 12:09:16','https://irctc.com/','https://www.irctc.com/assets/images/Notification%20for%20Walk-in-Interview%20for%20the%20post%20of%20Hospitality_Monitors_SCZ%20-%2028-10-2025.pdf',0),
(166,'Railway Recruitment Board (RRB) NTPC Graduate Recruitment 2026 - Submit Your Application Online for 5,810 Positions Including Station Master, Clerk, and Additional Roles','Railway Recruitment Board (RRB) NTPC','MH','Full-time','','RRB NTPC Recruitment 2025-26 notification! The Railway Recruitment Board has opened up 5,810 vacancies for positions like Station Master, Clerk, Traffic Assistant, and more. \n\nrrb ntpc vacancy 2025\nrrb ntpc notification 2025\n\n### Important Information:\n- **Company Name:** Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)\n- **Total Posts:** 5,810\n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs 25,500 to 35,400 \n- **Qualification Required:** Graduate\n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 33 years\n- **Application Period:** 21-10-2025 to 20-11-2025\n- **Official Website:** [rrbchennai.gov.in](http://rrbchennai.gov.in)\n\n### Vacancy Details:\n- Chief Commercial Cum Ticket Supervisor: 161\n- Station Master: 615\n- Goods Train Manager: 3,416\n- Junior Accounts Assistant Cum Typist: 921\n- Senior Clerk Cum Typist: 638\n- Traffic Assistant: 59\n\n### Application Fees:\n- **SC, ST, Ex-Servicemen, PwBD, Female, Transgender, Minorities, or EBC:** Rs 250\n- **All Other Candidates:** Rs 500\n\n### Selection Process:\n1. CBT 1 (Computer-Based Test 1)\n2. CBT 2 (Computer-Based Test 2)\n3. CBAT (Computer-Based Aptitude Test)\n4. Document Verification and Medical Examination\n\nBe sure to check the full eligibility criteria and apply within the given time frame. This is a great opportunity to join the Railway sector!',5810,'2025-11-05','2025-11-20','2025-10-29 12:13:41','https://www.rrbapply.gov.in/#/auth/landing','https://www.rrbchennai.gov.in/downloads/Final-CEN-06-2025-21-10-2025-Publish.pdf',0),
