(173,'National Highways Authority of India (NHAI) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 84 Positions Including Accountant, Stenographer, and Other Roles','National Highways Authority of India (NHAI)','AP','Full-time','','National Highways Authority of India (NHAI) recruitment for the year 2025, which includes 84 posts for the positions of Accountant, Stenographer, and other roles.\n\nHere are the key details:\n- **Company Name:** National Highways Authority of India (NHAI)\n- **Total Posts:** 84\n- **Pay Matrix:** Rs 25,500 to 1,77,500\n- **Qualifications:** Any Graduate, MBA/PGDM are eligible to apply.\n- **Age Limit:** Up to 30 years (specific limits apply for certain positions).\n\n**Important Dates:**\n- **Online Application Start Date:** 30-10-2025\n- **Online Application End Date:** 15-12-2025\n\nCandidates can apply through the NHAI official website at [nhai.gov.in](http://nhai.gov.in).\n\nI encourage any interested candidates to prepare their applications in advance and ensure they meet all eligibility criteria as specified in the official notification.\n',84,'2025-10-31','2025-12-15','2025-10-31 10:20:56','https://nhai.gov.in/#/','https://nhai.gov.in/nhai/sites/default/files/vacancy_files/Detailed-Advt-Hindi.pdf',0),
(174,'RRC North Western Railway Apprentices Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 2162 Positions','RRC North Western Railway (RRC NWR)','AP','Full-time','','RRC North Western Railway (RRC NWR) regarding the recruitment of 2162 Apprentices posts. This is an excellent opportunity for candidates looking to start their careers with RRC NWR.\n\n	\nrrb ntpc vacancy 2025\nrrb ntpc notification 2025\n\nHere are some key details about the recruitment:\n- **Advt No:** 04/2025 (NWR/AA)  \n- **Total Posts:** 2162  \n- **Application Fee:**  \n  - For SC/ST, Persons with Benchmark Disabilities (PwBD), and Women: **Nil**  \n  - For all Other Candidates: **100/-**  \n- **Important Dates:**  \n  - **Starting Date for Online Application:** 03-10-2025  \n  - **Last Date for Online Application:** 02-11-2025  \n- **Age Limit (as on 02-11-2025):**  \n  - Minimum Age: **15 Years**  \n  - Maximum Age: **24 Years**  \n  - Age relaxation applicable as per rules  \n- **Qualification Required:**  \n  - Candidates should possess ITI Pass in the relevant trade.\n\nPlease feel free to share this information with anyone who might be interested. Interested candidates can apply through the official RRC NWR website before the last date.',2162,'2025-11-05','2025-11-02','2025-10-31 10:27:53','https://rrcjaipur.in/','https://rrcjaipur.in/storeWebFiles/855_21400718.PDF',0),
(175,'Tehri Hydro Development Corporation (THDC) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 40 Positions of Assistant Manager and Senior Medical Officer','Tehri Hydro Development Corporation (THDC)','AP','Full-time','','Tehri Hydro Development Corporation (THDC) is pleased to announce the recruitment of 40 positions for Assistant Manager and Senior Medical Officer. We invite applications from candidates who meet the following criteria:\n\n**Post Name:** Assistant Manager, Senior Medical Officer  \n**No of Posts:** 40  \n**Pay Matrix:** Rs. 60,000 - 180,000  \n**Eligibility:** B.Sc, B.Tech/B.E, MBBS  \n**Age Limit:** 35 to 37 years  \n\n**Vacancies Breakdown:**\n- Assistant Manager (Civil) in E-3 Grade: 15  \n- Assistant Manager (Electrical) in E-3 Grade: 10  \n- Assistant Manager (Mechanical) in E-3 Grade: 10  \n- Senior Medical Officer in E-3 Grade: 5  \n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\n- **Assistant Manager:** Full Time B.E/B.Tech/B.Sc (Engg.) in relevant discipline with not less than 60% marks from a recognized University or institute.  \n- **Senior Medical Officer:** MBBS from institutes recognized by the Medical Council of India; Registration in Medical Council of India required.\n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- General and OBC/EWS category: Rs. 600/-  \n- SC/ST/PwBDs/Ex-Servicemen/Departmental candidates: NIL  \n\n**Important Dates:**\n- **Start Date for Online Application:** 07-11-2025  \n- **Last Date for Online Application:** 06-12-2025  \n\nInterested candidates can apply online through our official website: [thdc.co.in](http://thdc.co.in)',40,'2025-11-03','2025-12-06','2025-11-03 10:22:57','https://thdc.co.in/career/new-job-opening','https://thdc.co.in/sites/default/files/career/ASSISTANT_MANAGER_SENIOR_MEDICAL.pdf',0),
(176,'Army (Territorial Army) Rally Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 1529 Soldier Positions','Army (Territorial Army) Rally','AP','Full-time','','Territorial Army as a Soldier! The recruitment is for 1529 posts, and applications will be accepted offline from 15th November 2025 to 14th December 2025. This is a wonderful chance for eligible candidates to serve the nation and build a rewarding career.\n\n**Key Details of the Recruitment:**\n- **Company Name:** Territorial Army  \n- **Post Name:** Soldier  \n- **No of Posts:** 1529  \n- **Qualification:** 12TH, 10TH, 8TH  \n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 42 years  \n- **Official Website:** [territorialarmy.in](http://territorialarmy.in)\n\n**Vacancy Breakdown:**  \n- For Male Candidates: 107 Infantry Battalion (Territorial Army) 11 GORKHA RIFLES: 102, 113 Infantry Battalion (Territorial Army) RAJPUT: 129, and more.\n- For Both Male and Female Candidates: 164 Infantry Battalion (Territorial Army) NAGA: 437, etc.\n\n**Eligibility Criteria Includes:**\n- Soldier (General Duty): Class 10th pass with certain marks criteria.\n- Soldier (Clerk): 10+2 with 60% marks.\n- Soldier Tradesmen: Various qualifications based on specific trade requirements.\n\n**Physical Standards & Age Limit:**\nPlease refer to the official guidelines for detailed physical standards and age relaxation rules.\n\n**Application Process:**  \nCandidates can apply directly through the official website: [territorialarmy.in](http://territorialarmy.in). \\n\nI encourage interested candidates not to miss this opportunity and to submit their applications before the deadline.',1529,'2025-11-03','2025-12-14','2025-11-03 10:30:37','https://territorialarmy.in/','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/11/21545002-69059569ec9ab73730323.pdf',0),
(177,'Kendriya Vidyalaya Sangathan New Delhi (KVS New Delhi) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 03 Positions of Accountant and IT Staff','Kendriya Vidyalaya Sangathan New Delhi (KVS New Delhi)','DL','Full-time','','Kendriya Vidyalaya Sangathan New Delhi (KVS New Delhi) for the position of Accountant and IT Staff. Here are the key details:\n\n- **Company**: Kendriya Vidyalaya Sangathan New Delhi (KVS New Delhi)  \n- **Post Names**: Accountant (01), IT Staff (02)  \n- **Total Vacancies**: 03  \n- **Pay Matrix**: Rs. 40,000  \n- **Qualifications**:  \n   - Accountant: M.Com/B.Com/B.Sc. (Mathematics) with at least 60% marks  \n   - IT Staff: BCA/B.Sc. (Mathematics/Computer Science/IT) or B.Tech. (Computer Science/IT)  \n- **Age Limit**: Maximum 35 years, with age relaxation as per rules  \n- **Application Fee**: No fees required  \n- **Important Dates**:  \n   - Start Date for Apply Online: 31-10-2025  \n   - Last Date for Apply Online: 10-11-2025  \n- **Selection Process**: Shortlisted candidates will be contacted via e-mail  \n\nFor more information, please visit the official website: [edcilindia.co.in](http://edcilindia.co.in)\n\nFeel free to share this information with any interested candidates. ',3,'2025-11-03','2025-11-10','2025-11-03 10:41:32','https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdhcjpFIcUu_fL9xeHMp0QFaXfOAZCkwUVZ8gbZPnnJlJJ3jg/viewform?pli=1','https://www.edcilindia.co.in/Default/ViewFile/?id=1761937273945_Advertisement%20for%20hiring%20of%20Consultants%20on%20Contractual%20basis%20for%20PM-SHRI%20PMU%20at%20KVS%20%28Kendriya%20Vidyalaya%20Sangathan%29%20New%20Delhi.pdf&path=TCareer',0),
(178,'Satyawadi Raja Harish Chandra Hospital Recruitments - 2025 – Walk-in for 14 Senior Resident Positions','Satyawadi Raja Harish Chandra Hospital','DL','Full-time','','Satyawadi Raja Harish Chandra Hospital for the year 2025. The hospital is looking to fill 14 Senior Resident positions. This recruitment is open to candidates who hold an MBBS degree along with an MS/MD qualification.\n\n**Details of the Walk-in Interview:**  \n- **Start Date:** 03-11-2025  \n- **End Date:** 29-11-2025  \n- **Interview Days:** Every Monday to Friday (excluding Government Holidays) until all positions are filled.\n\n**Qualifications Required:**  \n- MBBS with Post Graduate degree or equivalent experience (in case of non-availability of PG candidates, two years of relevant specialty in a government or government institutional setting may be considered).  \n- Diploma from a recognized university, registered with the Delhi Medical Council (as per residency scheme).\n\n**Salary Offered:**  \n- Pay Scale: Level-11 (Rs. 67,700 - 2,08,700/-) plus other admissible allowances per month.\n\n**Age Limit:**  \n- Maximum Age Limit: 45 Years (age relaxation applicable as per rules).\n\nFor more detailed information, please visit the official website of Satyawadi Raja Harish Chandra Hospital at health.delhi.gov.in.',14,'2025-11-03','2025-11-29','2025-11-03 10:45:44','https://health.delhi.gov.in/','https://health.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/Health/circulars-orders/wsrhc_15.pdf',0),
(179,'Haryana State Cooperative Apex Bank (HARCO Bank) Cooperative Interns Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Offline for 13 Positions','Haryana State Cooperative Apex Bank (HARCO Bank)','HR','Full-time','','recently announced recruitment for 13 Cooperative Interns at Haryana State Cooperative Apex Bank (HARCO Bank). This presents an excellent opportunity for eligible MBA graduates looking to gain valuable experience in the banking sector.\n\nHaryana Govt Latest Job | Latest Bank Job \n\nHere are the details regarding the vacancies:\n\n- **Company Name**: Haryana State Cooperative Apex Bank (HARCO Bank)  \n- **Post Name**: Cooperative Interns  \n- **Number of Posts**: 13  \n- **Salary**: Rs. 25,000  \n- **Qualification**: MBA/PGDM  \n- **Age Limit**: 21 to 30 years  \n- **Last Date to Apply**: November 20, 2025  \n- **Official Website**: [harco.bank.in](http://harco.bank.in)\n\n**Location Details:**  \nInterns are needed at the State level in Chandigarh and at 12 District Central Cooperative Banks throughout Haryana – Ambala, Bhiwani, Faridabad, Fatehabad, Gurgaon, Hisar, Jhajjar, Jind, Rewari, Rohtak, Sirsa, and Yamunanagar.\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \nApplicants must have a BA or equivalent in Marketing Management/Cooperative Management/Agricultural Business Management/Rural Development Management, along with a permanent Resident of Haryana certificate. Proficiency in computer skills is essential.\n\n**Selection Process:**  \nCandidates will be shortlisted based on criteria by NABARD and called for an interview conducted by a designated committee. Selection will be based on average marks obtained throughout the academic carrier.\n\nThis is a great opportunity for eligible candidates to apply and embark on their career journey with HARCO Bank. Please share this information with any potential candidates who might be interested.',13,'2025-11-04','2025-11-20','2025-11-04 10:18:53','https://harco.bank.in/','https://harco.bank.in/uploads/news/1762236697_bd2a49c44c77111ced2e.pdf',0),
