(182,'Punjab National Bank (PNB)  LBO Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 750 Positions','Punjab National Bank (PNB) ','AP','Full-time','','Punjab National Bank (PNB) has opened recruitment for 750 Local Bank Officer Posts. This is a fantastic opportunity for recent graduates looking to build a career in banking.\n\nLatest Bank Job -\n\n**Details of the Recruitment:**\n- **Post Name:** Local Bank Officer  \n- **Number of Posts:** 750  \n- **Pay Scale:** Rs. 48480-85920  \n- **Qualification:** Any Graduate  \n- **Age Limit:** 20 to 30 years  \n\n**Application Timeline:**  \n- **Start Date for Online Application:** 03-11-2025  \n- **Last Date for Online Application:** 23-11-2025  \n- **Apply online at:** [pnb.bank.in](http://pnb.bank.in)\n\n**Vacancies by State:**  \n- Andhra Pradesh - 5 (Telugu)  \n- Gujarat - 95 (Gujarati)  \n- Karnataka - 85 (Kannada)  \n- Maharashtra - 135 (Marathi)  \n- Telangana - 88 (Telugu)  \n- Tamil Nadu - 85 (Tamil)  \n- West Bengal - 90 (Bengali)  \n- Jammu & Kashmir - 20 (Urdu/ Dogri/ Kashmiri)  \n- Ladakh - 3 (Urdu/ Purgi/ Bhoti)  \n- Arunachal Pradesh - 5 (English)  \n- Assam - 86 (Assamese/ Bodo)  \n- Manipur - 8 (Manipuri/ Meitei)  \n- Meghalaya - 8 (Garo/ Khasi)  \n- Mizoram - 5 (Mizo)  \n- Nagaland - 5 (English)  \n- Sikkim - 5 (Nepali/ Sikkimese)  \n- Tripura - 22 (Bengali/ Kokborok)  \n- **Grand Total:** 750\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \nCandidates must be graduates from a recognized university and hold a valid mark-sheet or degree certificate. Age relaxation is applicable as per government rules.\n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- For SC/ST/PwBD candidates: Rs. 59/-  \n- For all other candidates: Rs. 1180/-  \n\nFor more details, please refer to the official PNB website. We encourage all eligible candidates to apply before the deadline to avoid any last-minute issues.',750,'2025-11-04','2025-11-23','2025-11-04 10:23:16','https://pnb.bank.in/','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/11/025896500-69097761b366a76809673.pdf',0),
(183,'National Sanskrit University (NSKTU) Non-Teaching Recruitment 2025 - Submit Applications Offline for 09 Positions','National Sanskrit University (NSKTU)','AP','Full-time','','National Sanskrit University (NSKTU) as they are inviting offline applications for 09 Non Teaching posts. This is a great chance for eligible candidates to join a prestigious institution.\n\n**Details of the Recruitment:**\n- **Post Name:** Non Teaching Posts\n- **No of Posts:** 09\n- **Last Date for Apply:** 30-11-2025\n- **Official Website:** [nsktu.ac.in](http://nsktu.ac.in)\n\n**Vacancy Details:**\n1. Librarian (Direct/ Deputation) - 01\n2. Assistant Registrar - 01\n3. Professional Assistant - 01\n4. Laboratory Assistant (Education) - 01\n5. Laboratory Assistant (Language Lab & Technology Lab) - 01\n6. Upper Division Clerk - 01\n7. Library Attendant - 02\n8. Group \'C\' MTS - 01\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\nCandidates with qualifications ranging from B.Ed to Master\'s Degrees in relevant fields can apply. Please refer to the official website for detailed eligibility and requirements.\n\n**Age Limit:** \nMaximum age limit is 40 years, with relaxations applicable as per government rules.\n\n**Application Fee:** \n- UR/OBC/EWS male candidates: Rs 800/-\n- SC/ST/PwBD/Women Candidates: Exempted\n\nDon’t miss this opportunity! Please apply directly through the official NSKTU website before the deadline.',9,'2025-11-04','2025-11-30','2025-11-04 10:33:17','https://www.nsktu.ac.in',' https://nsktu.ac.in/storage/2025/10/Non-teaching-posts.pdf',0),
(184,'National Sanskrit University (NSKTU) Teaching Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 12 Positions','National Sanskrit University (NSKTU)','AP','Full-time','','National Sanskrit University (NSKTU) for the year 2025.\n\n**Job Summary:**\n- **Company Name:** National Sanskrit University (NSKTU)\n- **Post Name:** Teaching\n- **Number of Posts:** 12\n- **Qualifications:** Any Master\'s Degree, M.Phil/Ph.D\n- **Age Limit:** There is no upper age limit for teaching posts.\n\n**Application Dates:**\n- **Start Date for Apply Online:** 18 October 2025\n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 30 November 2025\n\nFor more information, you can visit the official website: [nsktu.ac.in](http://nsktu.ac.in)\n\n**Vacancy Details:**\n- Associate Professor in Yoga Vijnana: 01\n- Associate Professor in Agama: 01\n- Assistant Professor in Dharmasastra: 01\n- Assistant Professor in Visistadvaita Vedanta: 01\n- Assistant Professor in Sahitya: 02\n- Assistant Professor in Jyotisha & Vastu: 02\n- Assistant Professor in Research & Publications: 01\n- Assistant Professor Vyakarana: 01\n- Assistant Professor in Education: 01\n- Assistant Professor in Sabdabodha Systems Computational Linguistics: 01\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\n- A good academic record with a Ph.D. Degree in the subject concerned/allied/relevant discipline.\n- A Master\'s Degree with at least 55% marks (or an equivalent grade in a point-scale, wherever the grading system is followed).\n\n**Application Fees:**\n- For UR/OBC/EWS Male candidates: Rs.800/-\n- For SC/ST/PwBD/Women: NIL\n\nPlease let me know if you are interested in applying or if you need any more information.',12,'2025-11-04','2025-11-30','2025-11-04 10:44:09','https://curec.samarth.ac.in/index.php/search/site/index','https://nsktu.ac.in/storage/2025/10/Teaching-posts.pdf',0),
(185,'Bihar Staff Selection Commission (BSSC) Stenographer Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 432 Positions','Bihar Staff Selection Commission (BSSC)','BR','Full-time','','Bihar Staff Selection Commission (BSSC). They have released an official notification for 432 Stenographer posts, inviting interested and eligible candidates to apply online through the official BSSC website. \n\nHere are the key details:\n\n**Advt No**: 07/25  \n**Vacancy**: 432 Stenographer  \n**Application Fee**:  \n- General / OBC / EWS Candidates: ₹100/-  \n- SC / ST / PH Candidates: ₹100/-  \n*Payment Mode*: Online via Debit Card, Credit Card, NET Banking or Pay Offline E-Challan.  \n**Important Dates**:  \n- Starting Date to Apply Online: 25-09-2025  \n- Last Date to Apply Online: 24-11-2025  \n- Last Date for Application Fee: 21-11-2025  \n**Age Limit**:  \n- Minimum: 18 Years  \n- Maximum: 37 Years (age relaxation as per rules)  \n**Qualification**: Candidates should possess a 12th pass certificate.  \n**Pay Scale**: Pay Level-4 (₹25,500 - ₹81,100)\n\nPlease let others know who might be interested. If you have any questions or need further information, feel free to ask.\n',432,'2025-11-04','2025-11-24','2025-11-04 10:47:28','https://bssc.bihar.gov.in/NoticeBoard.htm','https://img2.freejobalert.com/news/2025/09/852963-68ce277a409ef80784629.pdf',0),
(186,'Burari Hospital Delhi is recruiting Senior Residents for the year 2025 – Walk in for 20 available positions.','Burari Hospital Delhi','DL','Full-time','','Burari Hospital is inviting applications for the recruitment of 20 Senior Residents in various specialties. Candidates who hold MBBS, DNB, PG Diploma, MS/MD are eligible to attend the walk-in interview.\n\n**Important Information:**\n- **Date of Walk-in Interview:** 07-11-2025  \n- **Maximum Age Limit:** 45 Years (Age relaxation as per rules)  \n- **Qualifications Required:**  \n   MBBS with Postgraduate degree/DNB/Diploma or equivalent in the concerned specialty from a recognized University/Institute.  \n   Candidates with 2 years of experience in the relevant department may be considered on an ad-hoc basis in the absence of MD/DNB certificates.  \n   For the Dental branch, a BDS with a postgraduate degree/MDS is required.\n\n**Vacancy Details by Specialty:**  \n- Orthopaedic: 06  \n- Pulmonology: 02  \n- Medicine: 02  \n- Paediatrics: 02  \n- OBG: 03  \n- Microbiology: 01  \n- Radiology: 02  \n- Pathology: 01  \n- Dental: 01  \n\n**Salary Information:**  \nThe pay scale will be in accordance with the 7th CPC guidelines as adopted by the GNCT of Delhi.\n\nFor more details, please visit the official website of Burari Hospital: [health.delhi.gov.in](http://health.delhi.gov.in)\n\nWe look forward to seeing you at the walk-in interview!\n\nDelhi Govt Job\nHospital Job\nLatest Delhi Job',20,'2025-11-05','2025-11-07','2025-11-05 07:56:58','https://health.delhi.gov.in/','https://health.delhi.gov.in/sites/default/files/Health/circulars-orders/wbur_10.pdf',0),
(188,'National Housing Bank (NHB) Officers Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 10 Positions Including Assistant Manager, Head, and Other Roles','National Housing Bank (NHB)','All-India','Full-time','','National Housing Bank (NHB) for the year 2025. They are looking to fill a total of 10 posts with varied qualifications. Here are the details:\n\n**Company Name:** National Housing Bank (NHB)  \n**Post Name:** Officers  \n**No of Posts:** 10  \n**Salary:** Rs 85,920 to 156,500  \n**Qualification:** CA, MBA/PGDM, MCA  \n**Age Limit:** 21 to 62 years  \n**Start Date for Apply Online:** 07-11-2025  \n**Last Date for Apply Online:** 28-11-2025  \n**Official Website:** [nhb.org.in](http://nhb.org.in)  \n\n### NHB Officers Recruitment 2025 Vacancy Details:  \n- Dy. General Manager – Credit Monitoring: 01  \n- Dy. General Manager – Sustainable Finance: 01  \n- Assistant General Manager – Credit (Backlog): 01  \n- Assistant Manager - Learning & Development: 01  \n- Assistant Manager – Audit: 02  \n- Chief Information Security Officer: 01  \n- Head: Learning & Development: 01  \n- Senior Tax Officer: 02  \n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**  \n- **Deputy General Manager:** CA/MBA/PGDM  \n- **Assistant General Manager - Credit:** Graduate with CA/CMA/MBA (Finance) or equivalent  \n- **Assistant Manager - Audit:** CA  \n- **Chief Information Security Officer:** Relevant Engineering degree/MCA  \n- **Senior Tax Officer:** CA  \n\n**Application Fee:**  \n- SC/ST/PwBD Candidates: Rs 175/-  \n- Others: Rs 850/-  \n\nThis is a great opportunity for eligible candidates, and I encourage you to share this information with anyone who might be interested. For more details and to apply, please visit the official website of NHB.',850,'2025-11-08','2025-11-28','2025-11-08 06:33:43','https://recruitment.nhbonline.org.in/','https://www.nhb.org.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Advertisement-regular-positions-25-26-03-Final-Version.pdf?prophazecheck=3',0),
(189,'Rail India Technical and Economic Service (RITES)  Manager Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 40 Positions','Rail India Technical and Economic Service (RITES) ','All-India','Full-time','','Rail India Technical and Economic Service (RITES) has announced the opening for 40 Manager positions. This could be a great chance for candidates with a B.Tech/B.E qualification to apply and join a reputable organization. \n\n**Position Details:**  \n- **Company Name:** Rail India Technical and Economic Service (RITES)  \n- **Post Name:** Manager  \n- **Number of Posts:** 40  \n- **Salary:** Rs. 50,000 - 1,60,000  \n- **Qualification Required:** B.Tech/B.E  \n- **Age Limit:** Up to 40 years (age relaxation as per rules)  \n\n**Application Fees:**  \n- General/OBC Candidates: Rs. 600/- plus applicable taxes  \n- EWS/SC/ST/PWD Candidates: Rs. 300/- plus applicable taxes  \n\n**Important Dates:**  \n- **Start Date for Online Application:** November 07, 2025  \n- **Last Date for Online Application:** November 30, 2025  \n\nFor more details, please visit the official website at [rites.com](https://rites.com).\n\nFeel free to share this email with anyone who might be interested. Best of luck to all applicants!\n',300,'2025-11-08','2025-11-30','2025-11-08 11:09:22','https://www.rites.com/Upload/Career/CP3125_pdf-2025-Nov-07-16-38-45.pdf','https://www.rites.com/Career',0),
(190,'Anusandhan National Research Foundation (ANRF) Recruitment 2025 - Submit Offline Applications for 07 Positions of Scientist D and Scientist C','Anusandhan National Research Foundation (ANRF)','All-India','Full-time','','Anusandhan National Research Foundation (ANRF). They have just announced the recruitment for 07 posts of Scientist D and Scientist C. If you or someone you know is interested, I encourage you to apply!\n\nHere are the key details:\n- **Company Name:** Anusandhan National Research Foundation (ANRF)\n- **Post Names:** Scientist D (2 posts) and Scientist C (5 posts)\n- **Salary:** Scientist D: Rs. 78,800-209,200; Scientist C: Rs. 67,700-208,700\n- **Qualifications:** Bachelor\'s or Master\'s Degree in relevant disciplines\n- **Age Limit:** Up to 40 years for Scientist D and up to 35 years for Scientist C (age relaxation applicable as per rules)\n- **Application Start Date:** 25-10-2025\n- **Application Last Date:** 08-12-2025 \n- **Application Mode:** Offline through the official website serb.gov.in \n\nDon’t miss out on this chance to take a step forward in your career! Make sure to submit your application before the deadline.\n',7,'2025-11-10','2025-12-08','2025-11-10 09:42:45','https://serb.gov.in/','https://serb.gov.in/assets/pdf/Detailed_Adv_Direct_Recruitment_2025_Scientist_D_and_C.pdf',0),
(191,'Bank of Baroda has released the PDF for Apprentices Recruitment 2025 - Submit your online application for 2700 positions.','Bank of Baroda ','All-India','Full-time','','Bank of Baroda Apprentices Recruitment for 2025. \n\nThe Bank has released a notification for the recruitment of 2700 Apprentices, aimed at graduates who are looking to kickstart their careers. Below are the key details you may find useful:\n\n- **Position**: Apprentices  \n- **No of Post**: 2700  \n- **Salary**: Rs. 15,000 per month  \n- **Eligibility**: Graduation in any discipline from a recognized University  \n- **Age Limit**: 20 - 28 years  \n- **Application Period**: From 11 November to 01 December 2025  \n- **Official Website**: [bankofbaroda.bank.in](https://bankofbaroda.bank.in)  \n\n### Vacancy Details by State/UT\n- Andhra Pradesh: 38  \n- Assam: 21  \n- Bihar: 47  \n- Delhi: 119  \n- Karnataka: 440  \n- Maharashtra: 297  \n- Uttar Pradesh: 307  \n- Others...\n\n### Selection Process\n1. Online Examination  \n2. Document Verification  \n3. Test of Local Language of the State  \n\n### Important Dates\n- **Start Date**: 11-11-2025  \n- **End Date**: 01-12-2025  \n\nCandidates can apply online through the official website. I recommend spreading the word to anyone who might be interested. ',2700,'2025-11-11','2025-12-01','2025-11-11 12:02:34','https://bankofbaroda.bank.in/career/current-opportunities/engagement-of-apprentices-under-the-apprentices-act-1961','https://bankofbaroda.bank.in/-/media/Project/BOB/CountryWebsites/India/Career/2025/25-11/11-11-2025-Advertisement-Apprenticeship-10-34.pdf',0),
