(199,'NSIL Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 47 Positions Including Project Scientist, Project Engineer, and Additional Roles','NewSpace India (NSIL)','All-India','Full-time','','NewSpace India (NSIL), which is currently inviting applications for various posts, including Project Scientist, Project Engineer, and Project Assistant. \n\n\nHere are the key details regarding the recruitment:\n\n- **Company Name:** NewSpace India (NSIL)\n- **No of Posts:** 47\n- **Salary Range:** Rs. 30,000 - 72,800\n- **Eligibility:** Graduate, B.Tech/B.E, Diploma, Any Post Graduate, M.E/M.Tech, M.Phil/Ph.D\n- **Age Limit:** 35 to 45 years\n- **Last Date to Apply Online:** 30-11-2025  \n- **Official Website:** [nsilindia.co.in](http://nsilindia.co.in)\n\n### Vacancy Details:\n- **Project Scientist:** 22 Posts\n- **Project Engineers:** 15 Posts\n- **Project Assistant:** 10 Posts\n\n### Important Notes:\n1. **Application Fee:** Rs. 250 for all candidates; SC/ST/PwBD/Ex-SM candidates are exempt.\n2. Review eligibility criteria carefully before applying, as the fee once paid will not be refunded.\n3. Age and qualification criteria are specified for each position; please refer to the official website for detailed criteria.\n\nThis is a great chance for qualified candidates to join a leading organization where they can contribute to significant projects in the field of space innovation.\n\nFeel free to share this information with anyone who may be interested.\n\nNewSpace India (NSIL) Karnataka vacancy \nBengaluru NewSpace India (NSIL)',47,'2025-11-13','2025-11-30','2025-11-13 11:55:34','https://www.nsilindia.co.in/','https://www.nsilindia.co.in/sites/default/files/Advt_for_FTC_positions.pdf',0),
(200,'SAIL MT Recruitment 2025 - Submit Your Application Online for 124 Management Trainee Positions','Steel Authority Of India (SAIL)','All-India','Full-time','','Steel Authority of India (SAIL) is excited to announce the recruitment for 124 Management Trainees posts. This is a fantastic opportunity for aspiring candidates to kickstart their careers in the engineering field.\n\n**Important Details:**\n- **Post Name:** Management Trainees\n- **Number of Posts:** 124\n- **Salary:** ₹ 50,000 - 160,000 per month\n- **Qualification:** B.Tech/B.E\n- **Age Limit**: Maximum 28 years as of 05-12-2025\n- **Online Application Start Date:** 15-11-2025\n- **Online Application End Date:** 05-12-2025\n- **Official Website:** [sail.co.in](https://sail.co.in)\n\n**Vacancy Details by Engineering Discipline:**\n- Chemical: 05\n- Civil: 14\n- Computer: 04\n- Electrical: 44\n- Instrumentation: 07\n- Mechanical: 30\n- Metallurgy: 20\n\n**Eligibility Criteria:**\nCandidates must possess a degree in engineering with at least 65% marks in any of the listed disciplines. Age relaxation applicable as per rules.\n\n**Application Fee:**\n- General/OBC (NCL)/EWS Candidates: ₹ 1050/-\n- SC/ST/PwBD/ESM/Departmental Candidates: ₹ 300/-\n\n**Selection Process:**\nThe selection will be through an online examination scheduled for Jan-Feb 2026. The exam will be divided into two parts: Domain Knowledge and Aptitude Test.\n\nFor more details regarding the recruitment, salary, and other benefits, please visit our official site at [sail.co.in](https://sail.co.in).\n\nWe encourage eligible candidates to apply within the stipulated timeframe. Best of luck to all applicants!\n\nLatest Central Govt job\nLatest Central Govt Vacancy',124,'2025-11-13','2025-12-05','2025-11-13 11:59:25','https://sail.co.in/','https://aima-web-images.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/sailcareers.com/Downloads/MTR_News_12112025_163510.pdf',0),
(201,'Western Coalfields (WCL) has released the PDF for Apprentices Recruitment 2025 - Online applications are invited for 1213 positions.','Western Coalfields (WCL)','All-India','Full-time','','apply for apprenticeships with Western Coalfields (WCL). The recruitment process for 1213 posts of Apprentices is set to begin soon. Here are the key details:\n\n- **Company Name:** Western Coalfields (WCL)  \n- **Post Name:** Apprentices  \n- **Total Posts:** 1213  \n- **Salary:** ₹8,200 to ₹12,300  \n- **Qualification:** B.Tech/B.E, Diploma, ITI, 12TH, 10TH  \n- **Age Limit:** 18 to 26 years  \n- **Start Date for Apply Online:** 17-11-2025  \n- **Last Date for Apply Online:** 30-11-2025  \n- **Official Website:** [westerncoal.in](http://westerncoal.in)\n\nCandidates should apply online through the WCL website during the application window. This is a fantastic chance for those interested in building a career in the coal industry.\n\nPlease feel free to share this information with anyone who might be eligible and interested.\n\nWCL  Betul (MP) Vacancy\nWCL  Chhindwara (MP) Vacancy\nWCL Nagpur Vacancy\n',1213,'2025-11-13','2025-11-30','2025-11-13 12:07:30','https://nats.education.gov.in/','https://docs.westerncoal.in/NOTIFICATION_WCL_HRD_51-2025.pdf',0);
